"1 à 3 séances ou longues marches":{"en":"1–3 workouts or long walks","es":"1 a 3 sesiones o paseos largos","pt":"1 a 3 treinos ou longas caminhadas","de":"1–3 Einheiten oder lange Spaziergänge","it":"1-3 allenamenti o lunghe passeggiate","nl":"1–3 trainingen of lange wandelingen","pl":"1–3 treningi lub długie spacery","tr":"1–3 antrenman veya uzun yürüyüş","ja":"1〜3回の運動または長めの散歩","ko":"운동 1~3회 또는 긴 산책","zh":"1–3次训练或长距离散步","ar":"1–3 تمارين أو مشي طويل","id":"1–3 latihan atau jalan kaki panjang"},
