"30 minutes, sans matériel, dans votre salon. Parfait pour s’y mettre en douceur.":{"en":"30 minutes, no equipment, in your living room. Perfect for easing in.","es":"30 minutos, sin material, en tu salón. Perfecto para empezar con suavidad.","pt":"30 minutos, sem equipamento, na sua sala. Perfeito para começar com calma.","de":"30 Minuten, ohne Geräte, im Wohnzimmer. Perfekt für einen sanften Einstieg.","it":"30 minuti, senza attrezzi, in salotto. Perfetto per iniziare con calma.","nl":"30 minuten, zonder materiaal, in je woonkamer. Ideaal om rustig te beginnen.","pl":"30 minut, bez sprzętu, w twoim salonie. Idealne na spokojny start.","tr":"30 dakika, ekipmansız, oturma odanda. Yavaş başlamak için ideal.","ja":"30分、器具なし、リビングで。無理なく始めるのに最適です。","ko":"30분, 도구 없이 거실에서. 부담 없이 시작하기에 좋아요.","zh":"30分钟，无需器械，在客厅就能练。非常适合循序渐进地开始。","ar":"30 دقيقة، بدون معدات، في غرفة المعيشة. مثالي للبدء بهدوء.","id":"30 menit, tanpa alat, di ruang tamu. Cocok untuk mulai pelan-pelan."},
"30 à 45 min":{"en":"30 to 45 min","es":"30 a 45 min","pt":"30 a 45 min","de":"30 bis 45 Min.","it":"Da 30 a 45 min","nl":"30 tot 45 min","pl":"30 do 45 min","tr":"30–45 dk","ja":"30〜45分","ko":"30~45분","zh":"30–45分钟","ar":"30 إلى 45 دقيقة","id":"30–45 menit"},
"4 séances : 2 haut du corps, 2 bas du corps. Plus de volume pour progresser.":{"en":"4 sessions: 2 upper body, 2 lower body. More volume to keep progressing.","es":"4 sesiones: 2 de tren superior y 2 de tren inferior. Más volumen para progresar.","pt":"4 treinos: 2 de membros superiores e 2 de inferiores. Mais volume para evoluir.","de":"4 Einheiten: 2× Oberkörper, 2× Unterkörper. Mehr Volumen für mehr Fortschritt.","it":"4 sessioni: 2 parte superiore, 2 parte inferiore. Più volume per progredire.","nl":"4 trainingen: 2 bovenlichaam, 2 onderlichaam. Meer volume om te blijven groeien.","pl":"4 treningi: 2 góra ciała, 2 dół ciała. Większa objętość, by dalej robić postępy.","tr":"4 antrenman: 2 üst vücut, 2 alt vücut. İlerlemeye devam etmek için daha fazla hacim.","ja":"週4回：上半身2回、下半身2回。成長を続けるためにボリュームを増やします。","ko":"4회: 상체 2회, 하체 2회. 꾸준히 성장하도록 볼륨을 늘려요.","zh":"4次训练：2次上肢，2次下肢。更大训练量，持续进步。","ar":"4 حصص: حصتان للجزء العلوي وحصتان للجزء السفلي. حجم أكبر لمواصلة التقدم.","id":"4 sesi: 2 tubuh atas, 2 tubuh bawah. Volume lebih besar agar terus berkembang."},
"4 séances ou plus":{"en":"4 or more sessions","es":"4 sesiones o más","pt":"4 treinos ou mais","de":"4 Einheiten oder mehr","it":"4 sessioni o più","nl":"4 of meer trainingen","pl":"4 lub więcej treningów","tr":"4 veya daha fazla antrenman","ja":"週4回以上","ko":"4회 이상","zh":"4次或以上","ar":"4 حصص أو أكثر","id":"4 sesi atau lebih"},
