"Coach qui ajuste votre journée, sans culpabilité":{"en":"A coach who adjusts your day, without guilt","es":"Un coach que ajusta tu día, sin culpa","pt":"Um coach que ajusta o seu dia, sem culpa","de":"Ein Coach, der deinen Tag anpasst – ohne schlechtes Gewissen","it":"Un coach che adatta la tua giornata, senza sensi di colpa","nl":"Een coach die je dag bijstuurt, zonder schuldgevoel","pl":"Coach, który dopasowuje twój dzień, bez poczucia winy","tr":"Gününü suçluluk hissettirmeden ayarlayan bir koç","ja":"罪悪感なしで一日を調整してくれるコーチ","ko":"죄책감 없이 하루를 조정해 주는 코치","zh":"帮你调整每一天、不让你内疚的教练","ar":"مدرّب يعدّل يومك بلا شعور بالذنب","id":"Pelatih yang menyesuaikan harimu tanpa rasa bersalah"},
