"Corps gainé du début à la fin.":{"en":"Core braced from start to finish.","es":"Abdomen firme de principio a fin.","pt":"Abdômen contraído do início ao fim.","de":"Rumpf von Anfang bis Ende angespannt.","it":"Addome contratto dall’inizio alla fine.","nl":"Romp aangespannen van begin tot eind.","pl":"Tułów napięty od początku do końca.","tr":"Gövde baştan sona sıkı.","ja":"最初から最後まで体幹を締めます。","ko":"처음부터 끝까지 코어에 힘을 주세요.","zh":"核心全程收紧。","ar":"الجذع مشدود من البداية إلى النهاية.","id":"Inti tubuh tegang dari awal sampai akhir."},
"Coudes collés au corps.":{"en":"Elbows tucked in to your body.","es":"Codos pegados al cuerpo.","pt":"Cotovelos colados ao corpo.","de":"Ellbogen eng am Körper.","it":"Gomiti aderenti al corpo.","nl":"Ellebogen dicht bij je lichaam.","pl":"Łokcie przy ciele.","tr":"Dirsekler vücuda yakın.","ja":"肘を体に寄せます。","ko":"팔꿈치를 몸에 붙이세요.","zh":"肘部贴近身体。","ar":"المرفقان ملتصقان بالجسم.","id":"Siku menempel ke badan."},
"Coudes fixes le long du corps.":{"en":"Elbows fixed at your sides.","es":"Codos fijos a los lados del cuerpo.","pt":"Cotovelos fixos ao lado do corpo.","de":"Ellbogen fest an den Seiten.","it":"Gomiti fermi lungo i fianchi.","nl":"Ellebogen vast langs je zij.","pl":"Łokcie nieruchomo przy bokach.","tr":"Dirsekler yanlarda sabit.","ja":"肘は体の横で固定。","ko":"팔꿈치를 옆구리에 고정하세요.","zh":"肘部固定在身体两侧。","ar":"المرفقان ثابتان على جانبيك.","id":"Siku tetap di sisi badan."},
"Coudes légèrement fléchis et fixes.":{"en":"Elbows slightly bent and locked in position.","es":"Codos ligeramente flexionados y fijos.","pt":"Cotovelos levemente flexionados e fixos.","de":"Ellbogen leicht gebeugt und fixiert.","it":"Gomiti leggermente piegati e fermi.","nl":"Ellebogen licht gebogen en vast.","pl":"Łokcie lekko ugięte i zablokowane.","tr":"Dirsekler hafif bükülü ve sabit.","ja":"肘を軽く曲げて固定。","ko":"팔꿈치를 살짝 구부려 고정하세요.","zh":"肘部微屈并固定。","ar":"المرفقان منثنيان قليلًا وثابتان.","id":"Siku sedikit ditekuk dan terkunci."},
"Coudes sous les épaules.":{"en":"Elbows under your shoulders.","es":"Codos bajo los hombros.","pt":"Cotovelos abaixo dos ombros.","de":"Ellbogen unter den Schultern.","it":"Gomiti sotto le spalle.","nl":"Ellebogen onder je schouders.","pl":"Łokcie pod barkami.","tr":"Dirsekler omuzların altında.","ja":"肘は肩の真下。","ko":"팔꿈치를 어깨 아래에.","zh":"肘部在肩膀正下方。","ar":"المرفقان تحت الكتفين.","id":"Siku di bawah bahu."},
"Créer ma semaine":{"en":"Create my week","es":"Crear mi semana","pt":"Criar minha semana","de":"Meine Woche erstellen","it":"Crea la mia settimana","nl":"Mijn week maken","pl":"Utwórz mój tydzień","tr":"Haftamı oluştur","ja":"1週間を作成","ko":"내 일주일 만들기","zh":"生成我的一周","ar":"إنشاء أسبوعي","id":"Buat mingguku"},
