"Dos neutre, remontez en poussant dans les talons.":{"en":"Neutral back, drive up through your heels.","es":"Espalda neutra, sube empujando con los talones.","pt":"Coluna neutra, suba empurrando pelos calcanhares.","de":"Neutraler Rücken, über die Fersen hochdrücken.","it":"Schiena neutra, risali spingendo con i talloni.","nl":"Neutrale rug, kom omhoog via je hielen.","pl":"Neutralne plecy, wstań, odpychając się piętami.","tr":"Sırt nötr, topuklarından iterek kalk.","ja":"背中はニュートラル、かかとで押して立ち上がります。","ko":"등은 중립, 발뒤꿈치로 밀며 일어나세요.","zh":"背部保持中立，脚跟发力站起。","ar":"ظهر محايد، وانهض بالدفع من الكعبين.","id":"Punggung netral, dorong dari tumit untuk naik."},
"Dos plat, buste incliné vers l’avant.":{"en":"Flat back, torso tilted forward.","es":"Espalda recta, torso inclinado hacia delante.","pt":"Costas retas, tronco inclinado para a frente.","de":"Gerader Rücken, Oberkörper nach vorne geneigt.","it":"Schiena piatta, busto inclinato in avanti.","nl":"Platte rug, romp naar voren gekanteld.","pl":"Płaskie plecy, tułów pochylony do przodu.","tr":"Sırt düz, gövde öne eğik.","ja":"背中はまっすぐ、上体を前に傾けます。","ko":"등을 평평하게, 상체를 앞으로 기울이세요.","zh":"背部平直，上身前倾。","ar":"ظهر مستقيم والجذع مائل للأمام.","id":"Punggung rata, badan condong ke depan."},
"Dos · Épaules · Pectoraux":{"en":"Back · Shoulders · Chest","es":"Espalda · Hombros · Pecho","pt":"Costas · Ombros · Peito","de":"Rücken · Schultern · Brust","it":"Schiena · Spalle · Petto","nl":"Rug · Schouders · Borst","pl":"Plecy · Barki · Klatka","tr":"Sırt · Omuzlar · Göğüs","ja":"背中・肩・胸","ko":"등 · 어깨 · 가슴","zh":"背 · 肩 · 胸","ar":"الظهر · الكتفان · الصدر","id":"Punggung · Bahu · Dada"},
"Durablement, sans régime extrême":{"en":"Lastingly, without extreme dieting","es":"De forma duradera, sin dietas extremas","pt":"De forma duradoura, sem dieta radical","de":"Dauerhaft, ohne extreme Diät","it":"In modo duraturo, senza diete estreme","nl":"Blijvend, zonder extreme diëten","pl":"Trwale, bez skrajnych diet","tr":"Kalıcı olarak, aşırı diyet olmadan","ja":"極端な食事制限なしで、長く続けて","ko":"극단적인 다이어트 없이 꾸준하게","zh":"持久有效，无需极端节食","ar":"بشكل دائم، دون حمية قاسية","id":"Bertahan lama, tanpa diet ekstrem"},
"Débloquer mon programme":{"en":"Unlock my programme","es":"Desbloquear mi programa","pt":"Desbloquear meu programa","de":"Mein Programm freischalten","it":"Sblocca il mio programma","nl":"Ontgrendel mijn programma","pl":"Odblokuj mój program","tr":"Programımın kilidini aç","ja":"プログラムを解除する","ko":"내 프로그램 잠금 해제","zh":"解锁我的计划","ar":"افتح برنامجي","id":"Buka programku"},
"Début de l’abonnement, sauf si vous annulez avant.":{"en":"Your subscription starts, unless you cancel before.","es":"Empieza la suscripción, salvo que canceles antes.","pt":"A assinatura começa, a menos que você cancele antes.","de":"Dein Abo beginnt, sofern du nicht vorher kündigst.","it":"Inizia l’abbonamento, a meno che tu non annulli prima.","nl":"Je abonnement start, tenzij je eerder opzegt.","pl":"Subskrypcja się rozpoczyna, chyba że wcześniej ją anulujesz.","tr":"Önceden iptal etmezsen aboneliğin başlar.","ja":"事前に解約しない限り、サブスクリプションが始まります。","ko":"미리 해지하지 않으면 구독이 시작돼요.","zh":"除非你提前取消，否则订阅开始。","ar":"يبدأ اشتراكك ما لم تلغِه قبل ذلك.","id":"Langgananmu dimulai, kecuali kamu membatalkan sebelumnya."},
