"Essayer →":{"en":"Try it →","es":"Probar →","pt":"Experimentar →","de":"Ausprobieren →","it":"Prova →","nl":"Probeer het →","pl":"Wypróbuj →","tr":"Dene →","ja":"試してみる →","ko":"해 보기 →","zh":"试试看 →","ar":"جرّبه ←","id":"Coba →"},
"Estimation intermédiaire":{"en":"In-between estimate","es":"Estimación intermedia","pt":"Estimativa intermediária","de":"Mittlere Schätzung","it":"Stima intermedia","nl":"Gemiddelde schatting","pl":"Szacunek pośredni","tr":"Ara tahmin","ja":"中間の推定値","ko":"중간 추정치","zh":"折中估算","ar":"تقدير وسطي","id":"Perkiraan tengah"},
"Estimation selon le rythme choisi (≈ {speed} kg / semaine). Chaque corps est différent : NutriPilot ajuste votre plan selon vos résultats réels.":{"en":"Estimate based on your chosen pace (≈ {speed} kg / week). Every body is different: NutriPilot adjusts your plan to your real results.","es":"Estimación según el ritmo elegido (≈ {speed} kg / semana). Cada cuerpo es distinto: NutriPilot ajusta tu plan a tus resultados reales.","pt":"Estimativa com base no ritmo escolhido (≈ {speed} kg / semana). Cada corpo é diferente: o NutriPilot ajusta o seu plano conforme os resultados reais.","de":"Schätzung basierend auf deinem Tempo (≈ {speed} kg / Woche). Jeder Körper ist anders: NutriPilot passt deinen Plan an deine echten Ergebnisse an.","it":"Stima basata sul ritmo scelto (≈ {speed} kg / settimana). Ogni corpo è diverso: NutriPilot adatta il piano ai tuoi risultati reali.","nl":"Schatting op basis van je gekozen tempo (≈ {speed} kg / week). Elk lichaam is anders: NutriPilot past je plan aan je echte resultaten aan.","pl":"Szacunek na podstawie wybranego tempa (≈ {speed} kg / tydzień). Każde ciało jest inne: NutriPilot dopasowuje plan do twoich rzeczywistych wyników.","tr":"Seçtiğin tempoya göre tahmin (≈ {speed} kg / hafta). Her beden farklıdır: NutriPilot planını gerçek sonuçlarına göre ayarlar.","ja":"選んだペース（≈ {speed} kg / 週）に基づく推定です。体は人それぞれ。NutriPilotは実際の結果に合わせてプランを調整します。","ko":"선택한 속도(≈ {speed} kg / 주)에 따른 추정치예요. 몸은 모두 달라요. NutriPilot이 실제 결과에 맞춰 플랜을 조정해요.","zh":"基于你选择的节奏估算（≈ {speed} kg / 周）。每个人的身体不同：NutriPilot 会根据你的真实结果调整计划。","ar":"تقدير بناءً على الوتيرة التي اخترتها (≈ {speed} كغ / أسبوع). كل جسم مختلف: يعدّل NutriPilot خطتك وفق نتائجك الفعلية.","id":"Perkiraan berdasarkan kecepatan pilihanmu (≈ {speed} kg / minggu). Setiap tubuh berbeda: NutriPilot menyesuaikan rencana dengan hasil nyatamu."},
"Et le poids est revenu":{"en":"And the weight came back","es":"Y el peso volvió","pt":"E o peso voltou","de":"Und das Gewicht kam zurück","it":"E il peso è tornato","nl":"En de kilo’s kwamen terug","pl":"I waga wróciła","tr":"Ve kilolar geri geldi","ja":"そしてリバウンドした","ko":"그리고 체중이 돌아왔어요","zh":"然后体重又反弹了","ar":"ثم عاد الوزن","id":"Lalu berat badan kembali naik"},
"Ex. arachides, lactose, champignons…":{"en":"E.g. peanuts, lactose, mushrooms…","es":"Ej.: cacahuetes, lactosa, champiñones…","pt":"Ex.: amendoim, lactose, cogumelos…","de":"z. B. Erdnüsse, Laktose, Pilze…","it":"Es. arachidi, lattosio, funghi…","nl":"Bijv. pinda’s, lactose, champignons…","pl":"Np. orzeszki ziemne, laktoza, grzyby…","tr":"Örn. yer fıstığı, laktoz, mantar…","ja":"例：ピーナッツ、乳糖、きのこ…","ko":"예: 땅콩, 유당, 버섯…","zh":"例如：花生、乳糖、蘑菇……","ar":"مثل: الفول السوداني، اللاكتوز، الفطر…","id":"Mis. kacang tanah, laktosa, jamur…"},
