"Grand pas en avant, buste droit.":{"en":"Big step forward, torso upright.","es":"Paso largo hacia delante, torso recto.","pt":"Passo largo à frente, tronco ereto.","de":"Großer Schritt nach vorne, Oberkörper aufrecht.","it":"Passo lungo in avanti, busto dritto.","nl":"Grote stap naar voren, romp rechtop.","pl":"Duży krok do przodu, tułów wyprostowany.","tr":"Öne büyük adım, gövde dik.","ja":"大きく前に踏み出し、上体はまっすぐ。","ko":"앞으로 크게 한 걸음, 상체는 곧게.","zh":"向前跨大步，上身挺直。","ar":"خطوة كبيرة للأمام، والجذع مستقيم.","id":"Langkah besar ke depan, badan tegak."},
