"Je m’entraîne depuis quelques mois":{"en":"I’ve been training for a few months","es":"Entreno desde hace unos meses","pt":"Treino há alguns meses","de":"Ich trainiere seit ein paar Monaten","it":"Mi alleno da qualche mese","nl":"Ik train al een paar maanden","pl":"Trenuję od kilku miesięcy","tr":"Birkaç aydır antrenman yapıyorum","ja":"数か月トレーニングしています","ko":"몇 달째 운동 중이에요","zh":"我已经训练了几个月","ar":"أتدرّب منذ بضعة أشهر","id":"Aku sudah latihan beberapa bulan"},
"Je ne sais pas":{"en":"I don’t know","es":"No lo sé","pt":"Não sei","de":"Ich weiß es nicht","it":"Non lo so","nl":"Ik weet het niet","pl":"Nie wiem","tr":"Bilmiyorum","ja":"わからない","ko":"모르겠어요","zh":"我不知道","ar":"لا أعرف","id":"Aku tidak tahu"},
"Je ne sais pas combien manger":{"en":"I don’t know how much to eat","es":"No sé cuánto comer","pt":"Não sei quanto comer","de":"Ich weiß nicht, wie viel ich essen soll","it":"Non so quanto mangiare","nl":"Ik weet niet hoeveel ik moet eten","pl":"Nie wiem, ile jeść","tr":"Ne kadar yemem gerektiğini bilmiyorum","ja":"どれくらい食べればいいかわからない","ko":"얼마나 먹어야 할지 모르겠어요","zh":"我不知道该吃多少","ar":"لا أعرف كم يجب أن آكل","id":"Aku tidak tahu harus makan berapa banyak"},
"Je préfère ne pas répondre":{"en":"I’d rather not say","es":"Prefiero no responder","pt":"Prefiro não responder","de":"Möchte ich nicht angeben","it":"Preferisco non rispondere","nl":"Zeg ik liever niet","pl":"Wolę nie mówić","tr":"Söylememeyi tercih ederim","ja":"答えたくない","ko":"말하고 싶지 않아요","zh":"我不想说","ar":"أفضّل عدم القول","id":"Lebih baik tidak menyebutkan"},
"Je veux surtout que ça dure":{"en":"Above all, I want it to last","es":"Sobre todo quiero que dure","pt":"Quero principalmente que dure","de":"Vor allem soll es dauerhaft sein","it":"Soprattutto voglio che duri","nl":"Vooral wil ik dat het blijvend is","pl":"Przede wszystkim chcę, żeby to trwało","tr":"Her şeyden önce kalıcı olmasını istiyorum","ja":"何より長続きさせたい","ko":"무엇보다 오래 유지하고 싶어요","zh":"我最希望能持久","ar":"أريده قبل كل شيء أن يدوم","id":"Yang penting bisa bertahan lama"},
