"Me sculpter sans changer de poids":{"en":"Sculpt my body without changing weight","es":"Moldear mi cuerpo sin cambiar de peso","pt":"Definir o corpo sem mudar o peso","de":"Meinen Körper formen, ohne das Gewicht zu ändern","it":"Scolpire il corpo senza cambiare peso","nl":"Mijn lichaam vormen zonder van gewicht te veranderen","pl":"Wyrzeźbić sylwetkę bez zmiany wagi","tr":"Kilomu değiştirmeden vücudumu şekillendirmek","ja":"体重を変えずに体を引き締める","ko":"체중 변화 없이 몸매 다듬기","zh":"不改变体重塑造身形","ar":"نحت جسمي دون تغيير الوزن","id":"Membentuk tubuh tanpa mengubah berat"},
"Me sentir bien dans mon corps":{"en":"Feel good in my body","es":"Sentirme bien en mi cuerpo","pt":"Me sentir bem no meu corpo","de":"Mich in meinem Körper wohlfühlen","it":"Sentirmi bene nel mio corpo","nl":"Me goed voelen in mijn lijf","pl":"Dobrze czuć się w swoim ciele","tr":"Vücudumda kendimi iyi hissetmek","ja":"自分の体を心地よく感じたい","ko":"내 몸이 편안하게 느껴지도록","zh":"对自己的身体感觉良好","ar":"أن أشعر بالراحة في جسدي","id":"Merasa nyaman dengan tubuhku"},
"Me sentir bien à la plage":{"en":"Feel good on the beach","es":"Sentirme bien en la playa","pt":"Me sentir bem na praia","de":"Mich am Strand wohlfühlen","it":"Sentirmi bene in spiaggia","nl":"Me goed voelen op het strand","pl":"Dobrze czuć się na plaży","tr":"Plajda kendimi iyi hissetmek","ja":"ビーチで自信を持ちたい","ko":"해변에서 자신 있게","zh":"在海滩上自信满满","ar":"أن أشعر بالراحة على الشاطئ","id":"Percaya diri di pantai"},
