"Mes données sont-elles protégées ?":{"en":"Is my data protected?","es":"¿Están protegidos mis datos?","pt":"Meus dados estão protegidos?","de":"Sind meine Daten geschützt?","it":"I miei dati sono protetti?","nl":"Zijn mijn gegevens beschermd?","pl":"Czy moje dane są chronione?","tr":"Verilerim korunuyor mu?","ja":"データは保護されていますか？","ko":"내 데이터는 보호되나요?","zh":"我的数据受保护吗？","ar":"هل بياناتي محمية؟","id":"Apakah dataku terlindungi?"},
"Mieux manger sans y penser":{"en":"Eat better without overthinking","es":"Comer mejor sin pensarlo","pt":"Comer melhor sem esforço","de":"Besser essen, ohne viel nachzudenken","it":"Mangiare meglio senza pensarci","nl":"Beter eten zonder piekeren","pl":"Jeść lepiej bez kombinowania","tr":"Kafa yormadan daha iyi beslenmek","ja":"考えすぎずに食生活を整える","ko":"고민 없이 더 잘 먹기","zh":"轻松吃得更好","ar":"أن آكل أفضل دون تعقيد","id":"Makan lebih baik tanpa ribet"},
"Mieux vaut moins de séances tenues que trop de séances abandonnées.":{"en":"Better fewer sessions you stick to than too many you abandon.","es":"Mejor pocas sesiones que cumples que muchas que abandonas.","pt":"Melhor poucos treinos que você mantém do que muitos que abandona.","de":"Lieber weniger Einheiten, die du durchziehst, als zu viele, die du abbrichst.","it":"Meglio poche sessioni mantenute che troppe abbandonate.","nl":"Liever minder trainingen die je volhoudt dan te veel die je laat vallen.","pl":"Lepiej mniej treningów, które utrzymasz, niż za dużo, które porzucisz.","tr":"Bırakacağın çok antrenman yerine sürdürebileceğin az antrenman daha iyidir.","ja":"やめてしまう多すぎる回数より、続けられる少ない回数のほうが良いです。","ko":"포기할 만큼 많은 운동보다 꾸준히 할 수 있는 적은 운동이 나아요.","zh":"与其练太多而放弃，不如少练但坚持。","ar":"حصص أقل تلتزم بها خير من حصص كثيرة تتخلى عنها.","id":"Lebih baik sedikit sesi yang konsisten daripada banyak tapi ditinggalkan."},
"Mincir et mieux manger":{"en":"Slim down and eat better","es":"Adelgazar y comer mejor","pt":"Emagrecer e comer melhor","de":"Abnehmen und besser essen","it":"Dimagrire e mangiare meglio","nl":"Afvallen en beter eten","pl":"Schudnąć i jeść lepiej","tr":"Kilo vermek ve daha iyi beslenmek","ja":"やせて食生活を整える","ko":"체중 감량과 더 나은 식사","zh":"减重并吃得更好","ar":"إنقاص الوزن والأكل بشكل أفضل","id":"Turun berat badan dan makan lebih baik"},
"Moins de 15 min":{"en":"Under 15 min","es":"Menos de 15 min","pt":"Menos de 15 min","de":"Unter 15 Min.","it":"Meno di 15 min","nl":"Minder dan 15 min","pl":"Mniej niż 15 min","tr":"15 dakikadan az","ja":"15分未満","ko":"15분 미만","zh":"少于15分钟","ar":"أقل من 15 دقيقة","id":"Kurang dari 15 menit"},
