"Montez jusqu’à aligner épaules, hanches et genoux.":{"en":"Rise until your shoulders, hips and knees are aligned.","es":"Sube hasta alinear hombros, cadera y rodillas.","pt":"Suba até alinhar ombros, quadril e joelhos.","de":"Hebe dich, bis Schultern, Hüfte und Knie eine Linie bilden.","it":"Sali fino ad allineare spalle, anche e ginocchia.","nl":"Kom omhoog tot schouders, heupen en knieën op één lijn staan.","pl":"Unieś się, aż barki, biodra i kolana będą w linii.","tr":"Omuz, kalça ve dizler aynı hizaya gelene kadar yüksel.","ja":"肩・腰・膝が一直線になるまで上げます。","ko":"어깨, 골반, 무릎이 일직선이 될 때까지 올라가세요.","zh":"向上抬起至肩、髋、膝成一直线。","ar":"ارتفع حتى تصطف الكتفان والوركان والركبتان.","id":"Naik hingga bahu, pinggul, dan lutut sejajar."},
"Montez le bassin en serrant les fessiers.":{"en":"Lift your hips while squeezing your glutes.","es":"Sube la cadera apretando los glúteos.","pt":"Eleve o quadril contraindo os glúteos.","de":"Hebe das Becken und spanne den Po an.","it":"Solleva il bacino stringendo i glutei.","nl":"Til je heupen op en span je billen aan.","pl":"Unieś biodra, napinając pośladki.","tr":"Kalçalarını sıkarak kalçanı kaldır.","ja":"お尻を締めながら腰を持ち上げます。","ko":"엉덩이에 힘을 주며 골반을 들어 올리세요.","zh":"收紧臀部，抬起髋部。","ar":"ارفع الوركين مع شدّ الأرداف.","id":"Angkat pinggul sambil mengencangkan bokong."},
"Montez les bras jusqu’à l’horizontale, coudes légèrement fléchis.":{"en":"Raise your arms to shoulder height, elbows slightly bent.","es":"Sube los brazos hasta la horizontal, con los codos ligeramente flexionados.","pt":"Eleve os braços até a linha dos ombros, cotovelos levemente flexionados.","de":"Hebe die Arme bis auf Schulterhöhe, Ellbogen leicht gebeugt.","it":"Solleva le braccia fino all’orizzontale, gomiti leggermente piegati.","nl":"Til je armen tot schouderhoogte, ellebogen licht gebogen.","pl":"Unieś ręce do wysokości barków, łokcie lekko ugięte.","tr":"Kollarını omuz hizasına kaldır, dirsekler hafif bükülü.","ja":"肘を軽く曲げ、腕を肩の高さまで上げます。","ko":"팔꿈치를 살짝 굽히고 팔을 어깨 높이까지 올리세요.","zh":"手臂抬至肩高，肘部微屈。","ar":"ارفع ذراعيك إلى مستوى الكتفين مع ثني المرفقين قليلًا.","id":"Angkat lengan setinggi bahu, siku sedikit ditekuk."},
"Montez sans balancer le buste.":{"en":"Lift without swinging your torso.","es":"Sube sin balancear el torso.","pt":"Suba sem balançar o tronco.","de":"Hochführen, ohne mit dem Oberkörper zu schwingen.","it":"Sali senza dondolare il busto.","nl":"Til op zonder met je romp te zwaaien.","pl":"Unoś bez bujania tułowiem.","tr":"Gövdeni sallamadan kaldır.","ja":"上体を反動させずに上げます。","ko":"상체를 흔들지 말고 올리세요.","zh":"上抬时不要晃动身体。","ar":"ارفع دون أرجحة الجذع.","id":"Angkat tanpa mengayunkan badan."},
"Montez sur la pointe des pieds le plus haut possible.":{"en":"Rise onto your toes as high as you can.","es":"Ponte de puntillas lo más alto posible.","pt":"Suba na ponta dos pés o mais alto possível.","de":"Geh so hoch wie möglich auf die Zehenspitzen.","it":"Sali sulle punte il più in alto possibile.","nl":"Kom zo hoog mogelijk op je tenen.","pl":"Wspinaj się na palce jak najwyżej.","tr":"Parmak uçlarında olabildiğince yüksel.","ja":"できるだけ高くつま先立ちになります。","ko":"최대한 높이 발끝으로 올라서세요.","zh":"尽量踮高脚尖。","ar":"ارتفع على أصابع قدميك قدر الإمكان.","id":"Jinjit setinggi mungkin."},
