"Pause en haut, descente lente.":{"en":"Pause at the top, lower slowly.","es":"Pausa arriba, baja despacio.","pt":"Pausa em cima, desça devagar.","de":"Oben kurz halten, langsam absenken.","it":"Pausa in alto, discesa lenta.","nl":"Pauzeer bovenaan, laat langzaam zakken.","pl":"Zatrzymaj się na górze, opuszczaj powoli.","tr":"Üstte bekle, yavaşça indir.","ja":"上で止めて、ゆっくり下ろします。","ko":"위에서 멈췄다가 천천히 내리세요.","zh":"顶部停顿，缓慢下放。","ar":"توقف في الأعلى ثم انزل ببطء.","id":"Tahan di atas, turunkan perlahan."},
