"Redescendez lentement.":{"en":"Lower slowly.","es":"Baja despacio.","pt":"Desça devagar.","de":"Langsam absenken.","it":"Scendi lentamente.","nl":"Laat langzaam zakken.","pl":"Opuszczaj powoli.","tr":"Yavaşça indir.","ja":"ゆっくり下ろします。","ko":"천천히 내리세요.","zh":"缓慢下放。","ar":"انزل ببطء.","id":"Turunkan perlahan."},
"Redescendez à hauteur des oreilles.":{"en":"Lower to ear height.","es":"Baja hasta la altura de las orejas.","pt":"Desça até a altura das orelhas.","de":"Bis auf Ohrhöhe absenken.","it":"Scendi all’altezza delle orecchie.","nl":"Laat zakken tot oorhoogte.","pl":"Opuść do wysokości uszu.","tr":"Kulak hizasına indir.","ja":"耳の高さまで下ろします。","ko":"귀 높이까지 내리세요.","zh":"下放至耳朵高度。","ar":"أنزلها إلى مستوى الأذنين.","id":"Turunkan setinggi telinga."},
"Regardez votre jauge « Protéines » sur l’écran Aujourd’hui et complétez-la au dîner si besoin.":{"en":"Check your “Protein” gauge on the Today screen and top it up at dinner if needed.","es":"Mira tu indicador de «Proteínas» en la pantalla Hoy y complétalo en la cena si hace falta.","pt":"Confira o indicador de “Proteínas” na tela Hoje e complete no jantar, se precisar.","de":"Schau dir deine „Eiweiß“-Anzeige auf dem Heute-Bildschirm an und ergänze beim Abendessen, falls nötig.","it":"Controlla l’indicatore «Proteine» nella schermata Oggi e completalo a cena se serve.","nl":"Bekijk je meter “Eiwit” op het scherm Vandaag en vul hem zo nodig aan bij het avondeten.","pl":"Sprawdź wskaźnik „Białko” na ekranie Dziś i w razie potrzeby uzupełnij go przy kolacji.","tr":"Bugün ekranındaki “Protein” göstergene bak ve gerekirse akşam yemeğinde tamamla.","ja":"今日の画面で「たんぱく質」メーターを確認し、必要なら夕食で補いましょう。","ko":"오늘 화면의 ‘단백질’ 게이지를 확인하고 필요하면 저녁에 채우세요.","zh":"查看“今天”页面的“蛋白质”指标，需要时在晚餐补足。","ar":"تحقق من مؤشر «البروتين» في شاشة اليوم وأكمله في العشاء عند الحاجة.","id":"Cek indikator “Protein” di layar Hari ini dan lengkapi saat makan malam jika perlu."},
"Relâchez lentement vers l’avant.":{"en":"Release slowly forward.","es":"Suelta despacio hacia delante.","pt":"Volte devagar para a frente.","de":"Langsam nach vorne nachgeben.","it":"Rilascia lentamente in avanti.","nl":"Laat langzaam naar voren gaan.","pl":"Powoli oddaj do przodu.","tr":"Yavaşça öne bırak.","ja":"ゆっくり前に戻します。","ko":"천천히 앞으로 풀어 주세요.","zh":"缓慢向前放回。","ar":"أرخِ ببطء للأمام.","id":"Lepaskan perlahan ke depan."},
"Remontez en contractant les fessiers.":{"en":"Rise while squeezing your glutes.","es":"Sube contrayendo los glúteos.","pt":"Suba contraindo os glúteos.","de":"Komm hoch und spanne dabei den Po an.","it":"Risali contraendo i glutei.","nl":"Kom omhoog terwijl je je billen aanspant.","pl":"Wstawaj, napinając pośladki.","tr":"Kalçalarını sıkarak yüksel.","ja":"お尻を締めながら上がります。","ko":"엉덩이에 힘을 주며 올라오세요.","zh":"收紧臀部向上。","ar":"ارتفع مع شدّ الأرداف.","id":"Naik sambil mengencangkan bokong."},
"Remontez en contrôlant l’étirement.":{"en":"Return while controlling the stretch.","es":"Sube controlando el estiramiento.","pt":"Volte controlando o alongamento.","de":"Kontrolliert zurück in die Dehnung.","it":"Risali controllando l’allungamento.","nl":"Ga terug terwijl je de rek controleert.","pl":"Wracaj, kontrolując rozciąganie.","tr":"Gerilmeyi kontrol ederek geri dön.","ja":"ストレッチをコントロールしながら戻します。","ko":"늘어나는 느낌을 조절하며 돌아오세요.","zh":"控制拉伸感回到起始位置。","ar":"عُد مع التحكم في التمدد.","id":"Kembali sambil mengontrol regangan."},
"Remontez en expirant.":{"en":"Rise as you breathe out.","es":"Sube soltando el aire.","pt":"Suba soltando o ar.","de":"Beim Ausatmen hochkommen.","it":"Risali espirando.","nl":"Kom omhoog tijdens het uitademen.","pl":"Wstawaj na wydechu.","tr":"Nefes verirken yüksel.","ja":"息を吐きながら上がります。","ko":"숨을 내쉬며 올라오세요.","zh":"呼气时起身。","ar":"ارتفع مع الزفير.","id":"Naik sambil membuang napas."},
"Remontez en rapprochant les haltères sans les cogner.":{"en":"Press up, bringing the dumbbells together without clashing them.","es":"Sube juntando las mancuernas sin chocarlas.","pt":"Suba aproximando os halteres sem batê-los.","de":"Drück hoch und führe die Hanteln zusammen, ohne sie anzustoßen.","it":"Risali avvicinando i manubri senza farli urtare.","nl":"Duw omhoog en breng de dumbbells samen zonder ze te laten botsen.","pl":"Wypchnij, zbliżając hantle, ale ich nie zderzaj.","tr":"Dambılları çarpıştırmadan birbirine yaklaştırarak yukarı it.","ja":"ダンベルをぶつけずに寄せながら押し上げます。","ko":"덤벨이 부딪치지 않게 모으며 밀어 올리세요.","zh":"推起时双哑铃靠拢，但不要相撞。","ar":"ادفع للأعلى مع تقريب الدمبلز دون أن تصطدم.","id":"Dorong ke atas sambil merapatkan dumbbell tanpa membenturkannya."},
