"Tendez complètement les bras en bas.":{"en":"Fully straighten your arms at the bottom.","es":"Estira los brazos por completo abajo.","pt":"Estenda totalmente os braços embaixo.","de":"Strecke die Arme unten vollständig.","it":"Distendi completamente le braccia in basso.","nl":"Strek je armen onderaan volledig.","pl":"Wyprostuj ręce całkowicie na dole.","tr":"Kollarını aşağıda tamamen uzat.","ja":"下で腕を完全に伸ばします。","ko":"아래에서 팔을 완전히 펴세요.","zh":"底部手臂完全伸直。","ar":"مدّ ذراعيك بالكامل في الأسفل.","id":"Luruskan lengan sepenuhnya di bawah."},
"Tendez les jambes et marquez une pause en haut.":{"en":"Straighten your legs and pause at the top.","es":"Extiende las piernas y haz una pausa arriba.","pt":"Estenda as pernas e faça uma pausa em cima.","de":"Strecke die Beine und halte oben kurz.","it":"Distendi le gambe e fai una pausa in alto.","nl":"Strek je benen en pauzeer bovenaan.","pl":"Wyprostuj nogi i zatrzymaj się na górze.","tr":"Bacaklarını uzat ve üstte bekle.","ja":"脚を伸ばし、上で止めます。","ko":"다리를 펴고 위에서 멈추세요.","zh":"伸直双腿，顶部停顿。","ar":"مدّ ساقيك وتوقف في الأعلى.","id":"Luruskan kaki dan tahan di atas."},
"Tenez 2 secondes, redescendez.":{"en":"Hold for 2 seconds, then lower.","es":"Mantén 2 segundos y baja.","pt":"Segure 2 segundos e desça.","de":"2 Sekunden halten, dann absenken.","it":"Tieni 2 secondi, poi scendi.","nl":"Houd 2 seconden vast en laat dan zakken.","pl":"Przytrzymaj 2 sekundy, potem opuść.","tr":"2 saniye tut, sonra indir.","ja":"2秒キープしてから下ろします。","ko":"2초 유지한 뒤 내리세요.","zh":"保持2秒，然后下放。","ar":"اثبت ثانيتين ثم انزل.","id":"Tahan 2 detik, lalu turunkan."},
"Terminer la séance":{"en":"Finish workout","es":"Terminar la sesión","pt":"Finalizar treino","de":"Training beenden","it":"Termina l’allenamento","nl":"Training afronden","pl":"Zakończ trening","tr":"Antrenmanı bitir","ja":"トレーニングを終了","ko":"운동 마치기","zh":"完成训练","ar":"إنهاء الحصة","id":"Selesaikan latihan"},
"Tirage horizontal assis":{"en":"Seated cable row","es":"Remo sentado en polea","pt":"Remada sentada na polia","de":"Rudern am Kabelzug sitzend","it":"Pulley basso","nl":"Zittend roeien aan de kabel","pl":"Przyciąganie linki siedząc","tr":"Oturarak kablo row","ja":"シーテッドケーブルロウ","ko":"시티드 케이블 로우","zh":"坐姿绳索划船","ar":"التجديف الجالس على الكابل","id":"Seated cable row"},
"Tirage vertical":{"en":"Lat pulldown","es":"Jalón al pecho","pt":"Puxada alta","de":"Latziehen","it":"Lat machine","nl":"Latpulldown","pl":"Ściąganie drążka wyciągu górnego","tr":"Lat pulldown","ja":"ラットプルダウン","ko":"랫 풀다운","zh":"高位下拉","ar":"السحب العلوي","id":"Lat pulldown"},
"Tirez la barre vers le haut de la poitrine avec les coudes.":{"en":"Pull the bar towards your upper chest, leading with your elbows.","es":"Tira de la barra hacia la parte alta del pecho con los codos.","pt":"Puxe a barra até a parte de cima do peito, conduzindo com os cotovelos.","de":"Zieh die Stange mit den Ellbogen zur oberen Brust.","it":"Tira la barra verso la parte alta del petto guidando con i gomiti.","nl":"Trek de stang naar je bovenste borst, leidend met je ellebogen.","pl":"Przyciągaj drążek do górnej części klatki, prowadząc łokciami.","tr":"Barı dirseklerinle yönlendirerek üst göğsüne çek.","ja":"肘から引くイメージでバーを胸の上部へ引きます。","ko":"팔꿈치로 이끌며 바를 윗가슴 쪽으로 당기세요.","zh":"以肘部带动，将横杆拉向上胸。","ar":"اسحب البار نحو أعلى الصدر بقيادة المرفقين.","id":"Tarik bar ke dada atas dengan siku memimpin."},
"Tirez la poignée vers le ventre, coudes près du corps.":{"en":"Pull the handle towards your stomach, elbows close to your body.","es":"Tira del agarre hacia el abdomen, con los codos cerca del cuerpo.","pt":"Puxe o puxador em direção ao abdômen, cotovelos perto do corpo.","de":"Zieh den Griff zum Bauch, Ellbogen nah am Körper.","it":"Tira la maniglia verso l’addome, gomiti vicini al corpo.","nl":"Trek de handgreep naar je buik, ellebogen dicht bij je lichaam.","pl":"Przyciągaj uchwyt do brzucha, łokcie blisko ciała.","tr":"Tutacağı karnına çek, dirsekler vücuda yakın.","ja":"ハンドルをお腹に引き、肘は体の近くに。","ko":"손잡이를 배 쪽으로 당기고, 팔꿈치는 몸에 붙이세요.","zh":"将把手拉向腹部，肘部贴近身体。","ar":"اسحب المقبض نحو بطنك، والمرفقان قريبان من الجسم.","id":"Tarik pegangan ke perut, siku dekat badan."},
"Tirez vers le nombril en serrant les omoplates.":{"en":"Pull towards your belly button while squeezing your shoulder blades.","es":"Tira hacia el ombligo juntando los omóplatos.","pt":"Puxe em direção ao umbigo unindo as escápulas.","de":"Zieh Richtung Bauchnabel und zieh die Schulterblätter zusammen.","it":"Tira verso l’ombelico stringendo le scapole.","nl":"Trek naar je navel en knijp je schouderbladen samen.","pl":"Przyciągaj do pępka, ściągając łopatki.","tr":"Kürek kemiklerini sıkarak göbeğine doğru çek.","ja":"肩甲骨を寄せながらおへそに向かって引きます。","ko":"견갑골을 모으며 배꼽 쪽으로 당기세요.","zh":"收紧肩胛骨，拉向肚脐。","ar":"اسحب نحو السرة مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","id":"Tarik ke arah pusar sambil merapatkan tulang belikat."},
"Tous les programmes d’entraînement":{"en":"All training programmes","es":"Todos los programas de entrenamiento","pt":"Todos os programas de treino","de":"Alle Trainingsprogramme","it":"Tutti i programmi di allenamento","nl":"Alle trainingsprogramma’s","pl":"Wszystkie programy treningowe","tr":"Tüm antrenman programları","ja":"すべてのトレーニングプログラム","ko":"모든 운동 프로그램","zh":"所有训练计划","ar":"جميع برامج التمارين","id":"Semua program latihan"},
