"Votre tableau de bord : calories restantes, protéines, eau, check-in du jour et la prochaine décision à prendre.":{"en":"Your dashboard: calories left, protein, water, today’s check-in and the next decision to make.","es":"Tu panel: calorías restantes, proteínas, agua, check-in del día y la próxima decisión que tomar.","pt":"Seu painel: calorias restantes, proteínas, água, check-in do dia e a próxima decisão a tomar.","de":"Dein Dashboard: verbleibende Kalorien, Eiweiß, Wasser, Tages-Check-in und die nächste Entscheidung.","it":"La tua dashboard: calorie rimaste, proteine, acqua, check-in del giorno e la prossima decisione da prendere.","nl":"Je dashboard: resterende calorieën, eiwit, water, de check-in van vandaag en de volgende beslissing.","pl":"Twój pulpit: pozostałe kalorie, białko, woda, dzisiejszy check-in i kolejna decyzja.","tr":"Panelin: kalan kalori, protein, su, bugünkü check-in ve verilecek sonraki karar.","ja":"ダッシュボード：残りカロリー、たんぱく質、水分、今日のチェックイン、次の判断。","ko":"대시보드: 남은 칼로리, 단백질, 물, 오늘의 체크인, 다음 결정.","zh":"你的仪表盘：剩余热量、蛋白质、饮水、今日打卡和下一步决定。","ar":"لوحتك: السعرات المتبقية، البروتين، الماء، متابعة اليوم والقرار التالي.","id":"Dasbormu: sisa kalori, protein, air, check-in hari ini, dan keputusan berikutnya."},
"Votre tableau de bord mettra l’accent sur ce point.":{"en":"Your dashboard will focus on this.","es":"Tu panel se centrará en este punto.","pt":"Seu painel vai dar destaque a esse ponto.","de":"Dein Dashboard legt den Fokus darauf.","it":"La tua dashboard metterà l’accento su questo punto.","nl":"Je dashboard richt zich hierop.","pl":"Twój pulpit skupi się na tym.","tr":"Panelin buna odaklanacak.","ja":"ダッシュボードはこれを中心に表示します。","ko":"대시보드가 여기에 집중해요.","zh":"你的仪表盘将以此为重点。","ar":"ستركّز لوحتك على ذلك.","id":"Dasbormu akan fokus pada ini."},
"Voulez-vous un programme d’entraînement ?":{"en":"Would you like a training programme?","es":"¿Quieres un programa de entrenamiento?","pt":"Quer um programa de treino?","de":"Möchtest du ein Trainingsprogramm?","it":"Vuoi un programma di allenamento?","nl":"Wil je een trainingsprogramma?","pl":"Chcesz program treningowy?","tr":"Bir antrenman programı ister misin?","ja":"トレーニングプログラムを希望しますか？","ko":"운동 프로그램을 원하나요?","zh":"你想要训练计划吗？","ar":"هل تريد برنامج تمارين؟","id":"Mau program latihan?"},
"Vous pouvez atteindre {target} le {date}.":{"en":"You can reach {target} by {date}.","es":"Puedes alcanzar {target} el {date}.","pt":"Você pode chegar a {target} em {date}.","de":"Du kannst {target} bis {date} erreichen.","it":"Puoi raggiungere {target} il {date}.","nl":"Je kunt {target} bereiken tegen {date}.","pl":"Możesz osiągnąć {target} do {date}.","tr":"{date} tarihine kadar {target} hedefine ulaşabilirsin.","ja":"{date}までに{target}を達成できます。","ko":"{date}까지 {target}에 도달할 수 있어요.","zh":"你可以在{date}前达到{target}。","ar":"يمكنك الوصول إلى {target} بحلول {date}.","id":"Kamu bisa mencapai {target} pada {date}."},
"Vous prenez soin de votre santé.":{"en":"You’re taking care of your health.","es":"Cuidas de tu salud.","pt":"Você cuida da sua saúde.","de":"Du kümmerst dich um deine Gesundheit.","it":"Ti prendi cura della tua salute.","nl":"Je zorgt voor je gezondheid.","pl":"Dbasz o swoje zdrowie.","tr":"Sağlığına dikkat ediyorsun.","ja":"健康を大切にしています。","ko":"건강을 챙기고 있어요.","zh":"你在照顾自己的健康。","ar":"أنت تعتني بصحتك.","id":"Kamu menjaga kesehatanmu."},
"Vous rentrez à nouveau dans vos vêtements.":{"en":"You fit into your clothes again.","es":"Vuelves a entrar en tu ropa.","pt":"Você volta a caber nas suas roupas.","de":"Du passt wieder in deine Kleidung.","it":"Rientri di nuovo nei tuoi vestiti.","nl":"Je past weer in je kleren.","pl":"Znów mieścisz się w swoje ubrania.","tr":"Kıyafetlerine yeniden sığıyorsun.","ja":"服がまた入るようになります。","ko":"옷이 다시 맞아요.","zh":"你又能穿上以前的衣服了。","ar":"تناسبك ملابسك من جديد.","id":"Kamu muat lagi di pakaianmu."},
"Vous retrouvez confiance en vous.":{"en":"You regain your self-confidence.","es":"Recuperas la confianza en ti.","pt":"Você recupera a confiança em si.","de":"Du gewinnst dein Selbstvertrauen zurück.","it":"Ritrovi la fiducia in te.","nl":"Je krijgt je zelfvertrouwen terug.","pl":"Odzyskujesz pewność siebie.","tr":"Özgüvenini geri kazanıyorsun.","ja":"自信を取り戻せます。","ko":"자신감을 되찾아요.","zh":"你重拾自信。","ar":"تستعيد ثقتك بنفسك.","id":"Kamu mendapatkan kembali rasa percaya diri."},
"Vous retrouvez votre énergie.":{"en":"You get your energy back.","es":"Recuperas tu energía.","pt":"Você recupera sua energia.","de":"Du bekommst deine Energie zurück.","it":"Ritrovi la tua energia.","nl":"Je krijgt je energie terug.","pl":"Odzyskujesz energię.","tr":"Enerjini geri kazanıyorsun.","ja":"元気を取り戻せます。","ko":"에너지를 되찾아요.","zh":"你找回活力。","ar":"تستعيد طاقتك.","id":"Energimu kembali."},
