"Y aura-t-il des nutritionnistes et des coachs ?":{"en":"Will there be nutritionists and coaches?","es":"¿Habrá nutricionistas y coaches?","pt":"Vai ter nutricionistas e coaches?","de":"Wird es Ernährungsberater und Coaches geben?","it":"Ci saranno nutrizionisti e coach?","nl":"Komen er voedingsdeskundigen en coaches?","pl":"Czy będą dietetycy i trenerzy?","tr":"Diyetisyenler ve koçlar olacak mı?","ja":"栄養士やコーチはいますか？","ko":"영양사와 코치도 있나요?","zh":"会有营养师和教练吗？","ar":"هل سيكون هناك أخصائيو تغذية ومدرّبون؟","id":"Apakah akan ada ahli gizi dan pelatih?"},
