"Des nutritionnistes et coachs diplômés rejoindront NutriPilot pour vous accompagner.":{"en":"Qualified nutritionists and coaches will join NutriPilot to support you.","es":"Nutricionistas y coaches titulados se unirán a NutriPilot para acompañarte.","pt":"Nutricionistas e coaches qualificados vão chegar ao NutriPilot para acompanhar você.","de":"Qualifizierte Ernährungsberater und Coaches kommen zu NutriPilot, um dich zu begleiten.","it":"Nutrizionisti e coach qualificati arriveranno su NutriPilot per accompagnarti.","nl":"Gediplomeerde voedingsdeskundigen en coaches komen NutriPilot versterken om je te begeleiden.","pl":"Wykwalifikowani dietetycy i trenerzy dołączą do NutriPilot, by cię wspierać.","tr":"Uzman diyetisyenler ve koçlar sana eşlik etmek için NutriPilot’a katılacak.","ja":"資格を持つ栄養士とコーチがNutriPilotに加わり、あなたをサポートします。","ko":"자격을 갖춘 영양사와 코치가 NutriPilot에 합류해 당신을 도와요.","zh":"有资质的营养师和教练将加入 NutriPilot 陪伴你。","ar":"سينضم أخصائيو تغذية ومدرّبون مؤهلون إلى NutriPilot لمرافقتك.","id":"Ahli gizi dan pelatih bersertifikat akan bergabung dengan NutriPilot untuk mendampingimu."},
