"Eau, sel, digestion, sommeil et cycle peuvent déplacer le poids sans refléter une variation équivalente de masse grasse.":{"en":"Water, salt, digestion, sleep and your cycle can shift your weight without reflecting an equivalent change in body fat.","es":"El agua, la sal, la digestión, el sueño y el ciclo pueden mover el peso sin reflejar un cambio equivalente de grasa.","pt":"Água, sal, digestão, sono e ciclo menstrual podem alterar o peso sem refletir uma mudança equivalente de gordura.","de":"Wasser, Salz, Verdauung, Schlaf und Zyklus können das Gewicht verschieben, ohne dass sich der Fettanteil entsprechend ändert.","it":"Acqua, sale, digestione, sonno e ciclo possono far variare il peso senza riflettere una variazione equivalente di massa grassa.","nl":"Water, zout, spijsvertering, slaap en je cyclus kunnen je gewicht laten schommelen zonder dat je vetmassa evenveel verandert.","pl":"Woda, sól, trawienie, sen i cykl mogą zmieniać wagę bez równoważnej zmiany tkanki tłuszczowej.","tr":"Su, tuz, sindirim, uyku ve döngü, yağ kütlesinde eşdeğer bir değişim olmadan kiloyu oynatabilir.","ja":"水分、塩分、消化、睡眠、周期によって、体脂肪が同じだけ変わらなくても体重は動きます。","ko":"수분, 염분, 소화, 수면, 생리 주기는 체지방 변화 없이도 체중을 움직일 수 있어요.","zh":"水分、盐、消化、睡眠和生理周期都会让体重波动，并不代表脂肪等量变化。","ar":"قد يغيّر الماء والملح والهضم والنوم والدورة وزنك دون تغيّر مماثل في الدهون.","id":"Air, garam, pencernaan, tidur, dan siklus bisa menggeser berat tanpa perubahan lemak yang setara."},
"Encore un peu de données.":{"en":"A little more data needed.","es":"Faltan algunos datos.","pt":"Faltam alguns dados.","de":"Noch ein paar Daten nötig.","it":"Servono ancora un po’ di dati.","nl":"Nog wat meer gegevens nodig.","pl":"Potrzeba jeszcze trochę danych.","tr":"Biraz daha veri gerekiyor.","ja":"もう少しデータが必要です。","ko":"데이터가 조금 더 필요해요.","zh":"还需要多一点数据。","ar":"نحتاج إلى بيانات أكثر قليلًا.","id":"Perlu sedikit data lagi."},
"Enregistrer":{"en":"Save","es":"Guardar","pt":"Salvar","de":"Speichern","it":"Salva","nl":"Opslaan","pl":"Zapisz","tr":"Kaydet","ja":"保存","ko":"저장","zh":"保存","ar":"حفظ","id":"Simpan"},
"Entrer dans NutriPilot →":{"en":"Enter NutriPilot →","es":"Entrar en NutriPilot →","pt":"Entrar no NutriPilot →","de":"Zu NutriPilot →","it":"Entra in NutriPilot →","nl":"Naar NutriPilot →","pl":"Wejdź do NutriPilot →","tr":"NutriPilot’a gir →","ja":"NutriPilotへ →","ko":"NutriPilot 시작 →","zh":"进入 NutriPilot →","ar":"ادخل إلى NutriPilot ←","id":"Masuk ke NutriPilot →"},
"Entrez les 8 à 14 chiffres du code-barres. Les données disponibles proviennent d’Open Food Facts et restent à vérifier sur l’emballage.":{"en":"Enter the 8 to 14 digits of the barcode. Data comes from Open Food Facts and should be checked against the packaging.","es":"Introduce los 8 a 14 dígitos del código de barras. Los datos proceden de Open Food Facts y deben comprobarse en el envase.","pt":"Digite os 8 a 14 dígitos do código de barras. Os dados vêm do Open Food Facts e devem ser conferidos na embalagem.","de":"Gib die 8 bis 14 Ziffern des Barcodes ein. Die Daten stammen von Open Food Facts und sollten auf der Verpackung geprüft werden.","it":"Inserisci le 8-14 cifre del codice a barre. I dati provengono da Open Food Facts e vanno verificati sulla confezione.","nl":"Voer de 8 tot 14 cijfers van de barcode in. De gegevens komen van Open Food Facts en moet je controleren op de verpakking.","pl":"Wpisz 8–14 cyfr kodu kreskowego. Dane pochodzą z Open Food Facts i warto sprawdzić je na opakowaniu.","tr":"Barkodun 8–14 hanesini gir. Veriler Open Food Facts’ten gelir ve ambalajdan kontrol edilmelidir.","ja":"バーコードの8〜14桁を入力してください。データはOpen Food Factsのもので、パッケージで確認してください。","ko":"바코드 8~14자리를 입력하세요. 데이터는 Open Food Facts에서 가져오며 포장에서 확인하세요.","zh":"输入条形码的8–14位数字。数据来自 Open Food Facts，请与包装核对。","ar":"أدخل من 8 إلى 14 رقمًا للرمز الشريطي. البيانات من Open Food Facts ويجب التحقق منها على العبوة.","id":"Masukkan 8–14 digit barcode. Data berasal dari Open Food Facts dan perlu dicek di kemasan."},
