"Scannez, vérifiez les grammes, puis laissez NutriPilot adapter le reste de la journée.":{"en":"Scan, check the grams, then let NutriPilot adapt the rest of your day.","es":"Escanea, revisa los gramos y deja que NutriPilot adapte el resto del día.","pt":"Escaneie, confira os gramas e deixe o NutriPilot adaptar o resto do dia.","de":"Scannen, Gramm prüfen und NutriPilot den Rest des Tages anpassen lassen.","it":"Scansiona, controlla i grammi e lascia che NutriPilot adatti il resto della giornata.","nl":"Scan, controleer de grammen en laat NutriPilot de rest van je dag aanpassen.","pl":"Skanuj, sprawdź gramy, a NutriPilot dopasuje resztę dnia.","tr":"Tara, gramajı kontrol et, sonra gününün geri kalanını NutriPilot uyarlasın.","ja":"スキャンしてグラム数を確認し、残りの1日はNutriPilotにお任せ。","ko":"스캔하고 그램 수를 확인한 뒤, 남은 하루는 NutriPilot에 맡기세요.","zh":"扫描、核对克数，剩下的一天交给 NutriPilot 调整。","ar":"امسح، وتحقق من الغرامات، ثم دع NutriPilot يكيّف بقية يومك.","id":"Pindai, cek gramnya, lalu biarkan NutriPilot menyesuaikan sisa harimu."},
