"Ajoutez avoine et fruits.":{"en":"Add oats and fruit.","es":"Añade avena y fruta.","pt":"Acrescente aveia e frutas.","de":"Haferflocken und Obst dazugeben.","it":"Aggiungi avena e frutta.","nl":"Voeg havermout en fruit toe.","pl":"Dodaj płatki owsiane i owoce.","tr":"Yulaf ve meyve ekle.","ja":"オーツ麦と果物を加えます。","ko":"오트밀과 과일을 넣으세요.","zh":"加入燕麦和水果。","ar":"أضف الشوفان والفاكهة.","id":"Tambahkan oat dan buah."},
