"Économisez {n} % par rapport à Nutrition + Entraînement séparés":{"en":"Save {n} % compared with Nutrition + Training separately","es":"Ahorra un {n} % frente a Nutrición + Entrenamiento por separado","pt":"Economize {n} % em relação a Nutrição + Treino separados","de":"Spare {n} % gegenüber Ernährung + Training einzeln","it":"Risparmia il {n} % rispetto a Nutrizione + Allenamento separati","nl":"Bespaar {n} % ten opzichte van Voeding + Training los","pl":"Oszczędzasz {n} % w porównaniu z osobnym Żywieniem + Treningiem","tr":"Ayrı Beslenme + Antrenman’a göre %{n} tasarruf","ja":"栄養＋トレーニングを別々に買うより {n} % お得","ko":"영양 + 운동을 따로 구매할 때보다 {n} % 절약","zh":"比单独购买营养 + 训练节省 {n} %","ar":"وفّر {n} % مقارنة بالتغذية + التمرين منفصلين","id":"Hemat {n} % dibanding Nutrisi + Latihan terpisah"},
