"Gardez au moins un jour d’entraînement.":{"en":"Keep at least one training day.","es":"Mantén al menos un día de entrenamiento.","pt":"Mantenha pelo menos um dia de treino.","de":"Behalte mindestens einen Trainingstag.","it":"Mantieni almeno un giorno di allenamento.","nl":"Houd minstens één trainingsdag.","pl":"Zostaw co najmniej jeden dzień treningowy.","tr":"En az bir antrenman günü bırak.","ja":"トレーニング日を少なくとも1日残してください。","ko":"운동일을 최소 하루는 남겨 두세요.","zh":"至少保留一个训练日。","ar":"أبقِ يوم تمرين واحدًا على الأقل.","id":"Sisakan setidaknya satu hari latihan."},
"Choisissez au moins un jour.":{"en":"Choose at least one day.","es":"Elige al menos un día.","pt":"Escolha pelo menos um dia.","de":"Wähle mindestens einen Tag.","it":"Scegli almeno un giorno.","nl":"Kies minstens één dag.","pl":"Wybierz co najmniej jeden dzień.","tr":"En az bir gün seç.","ja":"少なくとも1日選んでください。","ko":"최소 하루를 선택하세요.","zh":"至少选择一天。","ar":"اختر يومًا واحدًا على الأقل.","id":"Pilih setidaknya satu hari."},
