"2 minutes de cardio léger pour monter la température.":{"en":"2 minutes of light cardio to warm up.","es":"2 minutos de cardio suave para entrar en calor.","pt":"2 minutos de cardio leve para aquecer.","de":"2 Minuten leichtes Cardio zum Aufwärmen.","it":"2 minuti di cardio leggero per scaldarsi.","nl":"2 minuten lichte cardio om op te warmen.","pl":"2 minuty lekkiego cardio na rozgrzewkę.","tr":"Isınmak için 2 dakika hafif kardiyo.","ja":"ウォームアップに軽い有酸素を2分。","ko":"워밍업으로 가벼운 유산소 2분.","zh":"2 分钟轻度有氧热身。","ar":"دقيقتان 2 من الكارديو الخفيف للإحماء.","id":"2 menit kardio ringan untuk pemanasan."},
"2 minutes de mobilité : hanches, épaules, chevilles.":{"en":"2 minutes of mobility: hips, shoulders, ankles.","es":"2 minutos de movilidad: caderas, hombros, tobillos.","pt":"2 minutos de mobilidade: quadril, ombros, tornozelos.","de":"2 Minuten Mobilität: Hüften, Schultern, Knöchel.","it":"2 minuti di mobilità: anche, spalle, caviglie.","nl":"2 minuten mobiliteit: heupen, schouders, enkels.","pl":"2 minuty mobilności: biodra, barki, kostki.","tr":"2 dakika hareketlilik: kalçalar, omuzlar, ayak bilekleri.","ja":"モビリティを2分：股関節、肩、足首。","ko":"가동성 2분: 고관절, 어깨, 발목.","zh":"2 分钟灵活性：髋、肩、踝。","ar":"دقيقتان 2 من المرونة: الوركان والكتفان والكاحلان.","id":"2 menit mobilitas: pinggul, bahu, pergelangan kaki."},
"2 séries légères du premier exercice de la séance.":{"en":"2 light sets of the session’s first exercise.","es":"2 series ligeras del primer ejercicio de la sesión.","pt":"2 séries leves do primeiro exercício do treino.","de":"2 leichte Sätze der ersten Übung der Einheit.","it":"2 serie leggere del primo esercizio della seduta.","nl":"2 lichte sets van de eerste oefening van de training.","pl":"2 lekkie serie pierwszego ćwiczenia treningu.","tr":"Antrenmanın ilk egzersizinden 2 hafif set.","ja":"メニュー最初の種目を軽く2セット。","ko":"첫 번째 동작으로 가벼운 2세트.","zh":"本次训练第一个动作做 2 组轻量。","ar":"مجموعتان 2 خفيفتان من أول تمرين في الحصة.","id":"2 set ringan dari latihan pertama sesi."},
