"Ajouter un article (ex. café, éponges)":{"en":"Add an item (e.g. coffee, sponges)","es":"Añadir un artículo (ej. café, esponjas)","pt":"Adicionar um item (ex. café, esponjas)","de":"Artikel hinzufügen (z. B. Kaffee, Schwämme)","it":"Aggiungi un articolo (es. caffè, spugne)","nl":"Iets toevoegen (bijv. koffie, sponzen)","pl":"Dodaj produkt (np. kawa, gąbki)","tr":"Bir ürün ekle (örn. kahve, sünger)","ja":"品目を追加（例：コーヒー、スポンジ）","ko":"항목 추가(예: 커피, 수세미)","zh":"添加物品（如咖啡、海绵）","ar":"أضف عنصرًا (مثل القهوة، الإسفنج)","id":"Tambah barang (mis. kopi, spons)"},
