"Brouillez les œufs à feu doux.":{"en":"Scramble the eggs over low heat.","es":"Revuelve los huevos a fuego lento.","pt":"Mexa os ovos em fogo baixo.","de":"Eier bei schwacher Hitze stocken lassen.","it":"Strapazza le uova a fuoco basso.","nl":"Roerbak de eieren op laag vuur.","pl":"Usmaż jajecznicę na małym ogniu.","tr":"Yumurtaları kısık ateşte karıştırarak pişir.","ja":"弱火で卵をスクランブルにします。","ko":"약불에서 달걀을 스크램블하세요.","zh":"小火炒散鸡蛋。","ar":"اخفق البيض على نار هادئة.","id":"Orak-arik telur dengan api kecil."},
