"Buste penché, bras collé au corps.":{"en":"Lean forward, upper arm tight to your body.","es":"Torso inclinado, brazo pegado al cuerpo.","pt":"Tronco inclinado, braço colado ao corpo.","de":"Vorgebeugt, Oberarm am Körper.","it":"Busto inclinato, braccio aderente al corpo.","nl":"Buig voorover, bovenarm tegen je lichaam.","pl":"Pochyl się, ramię przy tułowiu.","tr":"Öne eğil, üst kol vücuda yapışık.","ja":"前傾し、上腕を体に密着させます。","ko":"앞으로 숙이고 위팔은 몸에 붙이세요.","zh":"身体前倾，上臂贴紧身体。","ar":"انحنِ للأمام والعضد ملتصق بالجسم.","id":"Condongkan badan, lengan atas rapat ke badan."},
"Buste très droit à la descente.":{"en":"Very upright torso on the way down.","es":"Torso muy recto al bajar.","pt":"Tronco bem ereto na descida.","de":"Oberkörper beim Absenken sehr aufrecht.","it":"Busto molto dritto in discesa.","nl":"Romp heel rechtop bij het zakken.","pl":"Tułów bardzo wyprostowany przy opuszczaniu.","tr":"İnerken gövde çok dik.","ja":"下ろすときは上体をしっかり立てます。","ko":"내려갈 때 상체를 아주 곧게.","zh":"下放时上身保持挺直。","ar":"الجذع مستقيم جدًا أثناء النزول.","id":"Badan sangat tegak saat turun."},
