"Cassez les œufs dans la sauce et couvrez 6 minutes.":{"en":"Crack the eggs into the sauce and cover for 6 minutes.","es":"Casca los huevos en la salsa y tapa 6 minutos.","pt":"Quebre os ovos no molho e tampe por 6 minutos.","de":"Eier in die Sauce schlagen und 6 Minuten zudecken.","it":"Rompi le uova nel sugo e copri per 6 minuti.","nl":"Breek de eieren in de saus en dek 6 minuten af.","pl":"Wbij jajka do sosu i przykryj na 6 minut.","tr":"Yumurtaları sosun içine kır ve 6 dakika kapağını kapat.","ja":"卵をソースに割り入れ、ふたをして6分。","ko":"달걀을 소스에 깨 넣고 6분간 뚜껑을 덮으세요.","zh":"把鸡蛋打入酱汁，加盖焖 6 分钟。","ar":"اكسر البيض في الصلصة وغطّه 6 دقائق.","id":"Pecahkan telur ke dalam saus dan tutup 6 menit."},
