"Charge légère, dos toujours plat.":{"en":"Light weight, back always flat.","es":"Carga ligera, espalda siempre recta.","pt":"Carga leve, costas sempre retas.","de":"Leichtes Gewicht, Rücken immer gerade.","it":"Carico leggero, schiena sempre piatta.","nl":"Licht gewicht, rug altijd recht.","pl":"Lekki ciężar, plecy zawsze proste.","tr":"Hafif ağırlık, sırt her zaman düz.","ja":"軽い重量で、背中は常にまっすぐ。","ko":"가벼운 무게, 등은 항상 곧게.","zh":"轻重量，背部始终平直。","ar":"وزن خفيف والظهر مستقيم دائمًا.","id":"Beban ringan, punggung selalu lurus."},
"Chauffez la sauce tomate avec le thon émietté.":{"en":"Heat the tomato sauce with the flaked tuna.","es":"Calienta la salsa de tomate con el atún desmigado.","pt":"Aqueça o molho de tomate com o atum desfiado.","de":"Tomatensauce mit zerpflücktem Thunfisch erhitzen.","it":"Scalda la salsa di pomodoro con il tonno sbriciolato.","nl":"Verwarm de tomatensaus met de uit elkaar gehaalde tonijn.","pl":"Podgrzej sos pomidorowy z rozdrobnionym tuńczykiem.","tr":"Domates sosunu didiklenmiş ton balığıyla ısıt.","ja":"ほぐしたツナとトマトソースを温めます。","ko":"잘게 부순 참치와 토마토소스를 데우세요.","zh":"将番茄酱与撕碎的金枪鱼一起加热。","ar":"سخّن صلصة الطماطم مع التونة المفتتة.","id":"Panaskan saus tomat dengan tuna suwir."},
