"Choisissez vos jours et vos exercices, un par un.":{"en":"Pick your days and your exercises, one by one.","es":"Elige tus días y tus ejercicios, uno a uno.","pt":"Escolha seus dias e seus exercícios, um por um.","de":"Wähle deine Tage und Übungen, eine nach der anderen.","it":"Scegli i giorni e gli esercizi, uno per uno.","nl":"Kies je dagen en je oefeningen, één voor één.","pl":"Wybierz dni i ćwiczenia, jedno po drugim.","tr":"Günlerini ve egzersizlerini tek tek seç.","ja":"曜日とエクササイズをひとつずつ選びます。","ko":"요일과 동작을 하나씩 고르세요.","zh":"逐一选择训练日和动作。","ar":"اختر أيامك وتمارينك واحدًا تلو الآخر.","id":"Pilih hari dan latihanmu satu per satu."},
"Chou blanc":{"en":"White cabbage","es":"Repollo","pt":"Repolho","de":"Weißkohl","it":"Cavolo cappuccio","nl":"Witte kool","pl":"Biała kapusta","tr":"Beyaz lahana","ja":"キャベツ","ko":"양배추","zh":"白菜","ar":"ملفوف أبيض","id":"Kol putih"},
