"Dos collé au dossier.":{"en":"Back against the backrest.","es":"Espalda pegada al respaldo.","pt":"Costas encostadas no encosto.","de":"Rücken an der Lehne.","it":"Schiena aderente allo schienale.","nl":"Rug tegen de rugleuning.","pl":"Plecy przy oparciu.","tr":"Sırt arkalığa dayalı.","ja":"背もたれに背中をつけます。","ko":"등을 등받이에 붙이세요.","zh":"背靠靠背。","ar":"الظهر على مسند الظهر.","id":"Punggung menempel sandaran."},
"Dos droit, pieds au sol si besoin.":{"en":"Back straight, feet on the floor if needed.","es":"Espalda recta, pies en el suelo si hace falta.","pt":"Costas retas, pés no chão se precisar.","de":"Rücken gerade, Füße bei Bedarf am Boden.","it":"Schiena dritta, piedi a terra se serve.","nl":"Rug recht, voeten zo nodig op de grond.","pl":"Plecy proste, stopy na podłodze w razie potrzeby.","tr":"Sırt düz, gerekirse ayaklar yerde.","ja":"背中はまっすぐ、必要なら足を床に。","ko":"등은 곧게, 필요하면 발을 바닥에.","zh":"背部挺直，必要时脚踩地。","ar":"الظهر مستقيم والقدمان على الأرض عند الحاجة.","id":"Punggung lurus, kaki di lantai bila perlu."},
