"Déglacez avec le jus de citron.":{"en":"Deglaze with the lemon juice.","es":"Desglasa con el zumo de limón.","pt":"Deglaceie com o suco de limão.","de":"Mit Zitronensaft ablöschen.","it":"Sfuma con il succo di limone.","nl":"Blus af met het citroensap.","pl":"Zdeglasuj sokiem z cytryny.","tr":"Limon suyuyla tavanın dibini çöz.","ja":"レモン汁で鍋肌の旨みをこそげます。","ko":"레몬즙으로 디글레이즈하세요.","zh":"淋柠檬汁收汁。","ar":"أذب قاع المقلاة بعصير الليمون.","id":"Tuang air lemon untuk mengangkat sisa di wajan."},
