"Fléchissez complètement.":{"en":"Bend fully.","es":"Flexiona por completo.","pt":"Flexione totalmente.","de":"Vollständig beugen.","it":"Piega completamente.","nl":"Buig volledig.","pl":"Zegnij do końca.","tr":"Tamamen bük.","ja":"しっかり曲げます。","ko":"끝까지 굽히세요.","zh":"完全弯曲。","ar":"اثنِ بالكامل.","id":"Tekuk sepenuhnya."},
"Formez des boulettes et cuisez au four 20 minutes.":{"en":"Shape into balls and bake for 20 minutes.","es":"Forma bolitas y hornéalas 20 minutos.","pt":"Faça bolinhas e asse por 20 minutos.","de":"Bällchen formen und 20 Minuten backen.","it":"Forma delle polpette e cuocile in forno 20 minuti.","nl":"Vorm balletjes en bak 20 minuten in de oven.","pl":"Uformuj kulki i piecz 20 minut.","tr":"Top şekli ver ve fırında 20 dakika pişir.","ja":"丸めてオーブンで20分焼きます。","ko":"공 모양으로 빚어 오븐에 20분 구우세요.","zh":"揉成小球，烤 20 分钟。","ar":"شكّلها كرات واخبزها 20 دقيقة.","id":"Bentuk bola-bola dan panggang 20 menit."},
"Formez et grillez le steak de dinde haché.":{"en":"Shape and grill the minced turkey patty.","es":"Forma y asa la hamburguesa de pavo picado.","pt":"Modele e grelhe o hambúrguer de peru moído.","de":"Putenhack-Patty formen und grillen.","it":"Forma e griglia l’hamburger di tacchino macinato.","nl":"Vorm de burger van kalkoengehakt en grill hem.","pl":"Uformuj kotlet z mielonego indyka i grilluj.","tr":"Hindi kıymasından köfte yapıp ızgara yap.","ja":"七面鳥ひき肉でパティを作り、グリルします。","ko":"다진 칠면조로 패티를 빚어 구우세요.","zh":"用火鸡肉末做肉饼并烤熟。","ar":"شكّل قرص الديك الرومي المفروم واشوِه.","id":"Bentuk patty kalkun cincang dan panggang."},
