"Marinez le poulet avec les épices shawarma et faites-le griller.":{"en":"Marinate the chicken with shawarma spices and grill it.","es":"Marina el pollo con especias de shawarma y ásalo.","pt":"Marine o frango com tempero de shawarma e grelhe.","de":"Hähnchen mit Shawarma-Gewürzen marinieren und grillen.","it":"Marina il pollo con le spezie shawarma e grigliato.","nl":"Marineer de kip met shoarmakruiden en grill hem.","pl":"Zamarynuj kurczaka w przyprawach do szawarmy i grilluj.","tr":"Tavuğu şavurma baharatıyla marine edip ızgara yap.","ja":"鶏肉をシャワルマスパイスに漬けてグリルします。","ko":"닭고기를 샤와르마 향신료에 재워 구우세요.","zh":"鸡肉用沙威玛香料腌制后烤熟。","ar":"تبّل الدجاج بتوابل الشاورما واشوِه.","id":"Marinasi ayam dengan bumbu shawarma dan panggang."},
