"Mijotez 10 minutes, servez avec la moutarde.":{"en":"Simmer for 10 minutes, serve with mustard.","es":"Cuece 10 minutos, sirve con mostaza.","pt":"Cozinhe por 10 minutos, sirva com mostarda.","de":"10 Minuten köcheln, mit Senf servieren.","it":"Fai sobbollire 10 minuti, servi con la senape.","nl":"Laat 10 minuten sudderen en serveer met mosterd.","pl":"Duś 10 minut, podawaj z musztardą.","tr":"10 dakika kısık ateşte pişir, hardalla servis et.","ja":"10分煮込み、マスタードを添えます。","ko":"10분 끓이고 머스터드와 함께 내세요.","zh":"小火炖 10 分钟，配芥末上桌。","ar":"اتركه 10 دقائق على نار هادئة وقدّمه مع الخردل.","id":"Didihkan perlahan 10 menit, sajikan dengan mustard."},
"Mincir et mieux manger, sans régime extrême.":{"en":"Slim down and eat better, without extreme dieting.","es":"Adelgazar y comer mejor, sin dietas extremas.","pt":"Emagrecer e comer melhor, sem dieta radical.","de":"Abnehmen und besser essen, ohne extreme Diät.","it":"Dimagrire e mangiare meglio, senza diete estreme.","nl":"Afvallen en beter eten, zonder extreem dieet.","pl":"Schudnij i jedz lepiej, bez skrajnych diet.","tr":"Aşırı diyet yapmadan kilo ver ve daha iyi beslen.","ja":"極端な食事制限なしで、やせて食生活を整える。","ko":"극단적인 다이어트 없이 감량하고 더 잘 먹기.","zh":"不靠极端节食，瘦下来并吃得更好。","ar":"اخسر الوزن وكُل أفضل، دون حمية قاسية.","id":"Turunkan berat dan makan lebih baik, tanpa diet ekstrem."},
