"Nom de ma grille (ex. Ma routine 4 jours)":{"en":"Name of my schedule (e.g. My 4-day routine)","es":"Nombre de mi rutina (ej. Mi rutina de 4 días)","pt":"Nome da minha grade (ex. Minha rotina de 4 dias)","de":"Name meines Plans (z. B. Meine 4-Tage-Routine)","it":"Nome della mia scheda (es. La mia routine di 4 giorni)","nl":"Naam van mijn schema (bijv. Mijn 4-dagenroutine)","pl":"Nazwa harmonogramu (np. Moja rutyna na 4 dni)","tr":"Takvimimin adı (örn. 4 günlük rutinim)","ja":"スケジュール名（例：週4日ルーティン）","ko":"일정 이름(예: 나의 4일 루틴)","zh":"日程名称（如：我的 4 天常规）","ar":"اسم جدولي (مثل: روتيني لـ 4 أيام)","id":"Nama jadwalku (mis. Rutinitas 4 hari)"},
"Nos formules":{"en":"Our plans","es":"Nuestros planes","pt":"Nossos planos","de":"Unsere Pakete","it":"I nostri piani","nl":"Onze abonnementen","pl":"Nasze plany","tr":"Planlarımız","ja":"私たちのプラン","ko":"요금제 안내","zh":"我们的方案","ar":"خططنا","id":"Paket kami"},
"Nouilles de riz cuites":{"en":"Cooked rice noodles","es":"Fideos de arroz cocidos","pt":"Macarrão de arroz cozido","de":"Gekochte Reisnudeln","it":"Noodles di riso cotti","nl":"Gekookte rijstnoedels","pl":"Gotowany makaron ryżowy","tr":"Haşlanmış pirinç eriştesi","ja":"ゆでたビーフン","ko":"익힌 쌀국수","zh":"熟米粉","ar":"نودلز الأرز المطبوخة","id":"Bihun matang"},
"Nouilles soba cuites":{"en":"Cooked soba noodles","es":"Fideos soba cocidos","pt":"Macarrão soba cozido","de":"Gekochte Soba-Nudeln","it":"Soba cotti","nl":"Gekookte sobanoedels","pl":"Gotowany makaron soba","tr":"Haşlanmış soba eriştesi","ja":"ゆでたそば","ko":"익힌 소바","zh":"熟荞麦面","ar":"نودلز السوبا المطبوخة","id":"Mi soba matang"},
"Nutrition, entraînement et bien-être, dans une seule app.":{"en":"Nutrition, training and well-being, in one app.","es":"Nutrición, entrenamiento y bienestar, en una sola app.","pt":"Nutrição, treino e bem-estar, em um só app.","de":"Ernährung, Training und Wohlbefinden in einer App.","it":"Nutrizione, allenamento e benessere, in un’unica app.","nl":"Voeding, training en welzijn in één app.","pl":"Żywienie, trening i dobre samopoczucie w jednej aplikacji.","tr":"Beslenme, antrenman ve iyi oluş tek uygulamada.","ja":"栄養、トレーニング、ウェルビーイングをひとつのアプリで。","ko":"영양, 운동, 웰빙을 하나의 앱에서.","zh":"营养、训练和身心健康，一个应用全搞定。","ar":"التغذية والتمرين والعافية في تطبيق واحد.","id":"Nutrisi, latihan, dan kesejahteraan dalam satu aplikasi."},
"Nutrition, entraînement, ménopause ou tout à la fois. Changez de formule quand vous voulez.":{"en":"Nutrition, training, menopause or all at once. Switch plans whenever you like.","es":"Nutrición, entrenamiento, menopausia o todo a la vez. Cambia de plan cuando quieras.","pt":"Nutrição, treino, menopausa ou tudo junto. Troque de plano quando quiser.","de":"Ernährung, Training, Wechseljahre oder alles zusammen. Wechsle das Paket, wann du willst.","it":"Nutrizione, allenamento, menopausa o tutto insieme. Cambia piano quando vuoi.","nl":"Voeding, training, menopauze of alles tegelijk. Wissel van abonnement wanneer je wilt.","pl":"Żywienie, trening, menopauza lub wszystko naraz. Zmieniaj plan, kiedy chcesz.","tr":"Beslenme, antrenman, menopoz ya da hepsi birden. Planını istediğin zaman değiştir.","ja":"栄養、トレーニング、更年期、またはすべて。プランはいつでも変更できます。","ko":"영양, 운동, 갱년기 또는 전부. 언제든 플랜을 바꿀 수 있어요.","zh":"营养、训练、更年期，或全部。随时切换方案。","ar":"التغذية أو التمرين أو سن اليأس أو كلها معًا. غيّر خطتك متى شئت.","id":"Nutrisi, latihan, menopause, atau semuanya. Ganti paket kapan pun kamu mau."},
