"Oui : recettes, exercices, programmes et la première leçon de chaque cours sont visibles gratuitement.":{"en":"Yes: recipes, exercises, programs and the first lesson of every course are free to view.","es":"Sí: recetas, ejercicios, programas y la primera lección de cada curso se pueden ver gratis.","pt":"Sim: receitas, exercícios, programas e a primeira aula de cada curso podem ser vistos gratuitamente.","de":"Ja: Rezepte, Übungen, Programme und die erste Lektion jedes Kurses sind kostenlos sichtbar.","it":"Sì: ricette, esercizi, programmi e la prima lezione di ogni corso sono visibili gratuitamente.","nl":"Ja: recepten, oefeningen, programma’s en de eerste les van elke cursus zijn gratis te bekijken.","pl":"Tak: przepisy, ćwiczenia, programy i pierwsza lekcja każdego kursu są dostępne za darmo.","tr":"Evet: tarifler, egzersizler, programlar ve her kursun ilk dersi ücretsiz görüntülenebilir.","ja":"はい：レシピ、エクササイズ、プログラム、各講座の最初のレッスンは無料で見られます。","ko":"네: 레시피, 운동, 프로그램, 각 강좌의 첫 레슨은 무료로 볼 수 있습니다.","zh":"是的：食谱、动作、计划以及每门课程的第一课都可免费查看。","ar":"نعم: الوصفات والتمارين والبرامج والدرس الأول من كل دورة متاحة مجانًا للعرض.","id":"Ya: resep, latihan, program, dan pelajaran pertama setiap kursus bisa dilihat gratis."},
"Oui, à tout moment depuis les réglages de votre compte App Store ou Google Play.":{"en":"Yes, anytime from your App Store or Google Play account settings.","es":"Sí, cuando quieras desde los ajustes de tu cuenta de App Store o Google Play.","pt":"Sim, a qualquer momento nas configurações da sua conta da App Store ou do Google Play.","de":"Ja, jederzeit in den Einstellungen deines App-Store- oder Google-Play-Kontos.","it":"Sì, in qualsiasi momento dalle impostazioni del tuo account App Store o Google Play.","nl":"Ja, op elk moment via de instellingen van je App Store- of Google Play-account.","pl":"Tak, w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach konta App Store lub Google Play.","tr":"Evet, istediğin zaman App Store ya da Google Play hesap ayarlarından.","ja":"はい、App StoreまたはGoogle Playのアカウント設定からいつでも可能です。","ko":"네, App Store 또는 Google Play 계정 설정에서 언제든 가능합니다.","zh":"可以，随时在 App Store 或 Google Play 账户设置中操作。","ar":"نعم، في أي وقت من إعدادات حسابك في App Store أو Google Play.","id":"Ya, kapan saja dari pengaturan akun App Store atau Google Play."},
"Ouvrez les bras jusqu’à sentir l’étirement.":{"en":"Open your arms until you feel the stretch.","es":"Abre los brazos hasta notar el estiramiento.","pt":"Abra os braços até sentir o alongamento.","de":"Arme öffnen, bis du die Dehnung spürst.","it":"Apri le braccia fino a sentire l’allungamento.","nl":"Open je armen tot je de rek voelt.","pl":"Rozłóż ramiona, aż poczujesz rozciąganie.","tr":"Esnemeyi hissedene kadar kollarını aç.","ja":"伸びを感じるまで腕を開きます。","ko":"늘어나는 느낌이 들 때까지 팔을 벌리세요.","zh":"张开双臂直到感到拉伸。","ar":"افتح ذراعيك حتى تشعر بالتمدد.","id":"Buka lengan sampai terasa regangan."},
