"Poignée triangle, buste légèrement incliné.":{"en":"Triangle handle, torso slightly leaning back.","es":"Agarre triangular, torso ligeramente inclinado.","pt":"Pegador triângulo, tronco levemente inclinado.","de":"Dreiecksgriff, Oberkörper leicht zurückgelehnt.","it":"Maniglia a triangolo, busto leggermente inclinato.","nl":"Driehoekshandvat, romp licht naar achteren.","pl":"Uchwyt trójkątny, tułów lekko odchylony.","tr":"Üçgen tutamak, gövde hafif geride.","ja":"三角グリップで、上体を少し後ろへ。","ko":"삼각 손잡이, 상체는 약간 뒤로.","zh":"三角把手，上身略后仰。","ar":"مقبض مثلث والجذع مائل للخلف قليلًا.","id":"Pegangan segitiga, badan sedikit condong ke belakang."},
"Poignées à hauteur de poitrine.":{"en":"Handles at chest height.","es":"Agarres a la altura del pecho.","pt":"Pegadores na altura do peito.","de":"Griffe auf Brusthöhe.","it":"Maniglie all’altezza del petto.","nl":"Handgrepen op borsthoogte.","pl":"Uchwyty na wysokości klatki.","tr":"Tutamaklar göğüs hizasında.","ja":"グリップは胸の高さ。","ko":"손잡이는 가슴 높이.","zh":"把手在胸口高度。","ar":"المقابض بمستوى الصدر.","id":"Pegangan setinggi dada."},
