"Poitrine contre l’appui.":{"en":"Chest against the pad.","es":"Pecho contra el apoyo.","pt":"Peito contra o apoio.","de":"Brust am Polster.","it":"Petto contro l’appoggio.","nl":"Borst tegen het kussen.","pl":"Klatka oparta o oparcie.","tr":"Göğüs pede dayalı.","ja":"胸をパッドにつけます。","ko":"가슴을 패드에 대세요.","zh":"胸部贴住垫子。","ar":"الصدر على الوسادة.","id":"Dada menempel di bantalan."},
"Poitrine haute, dos plat.":{"en":"Chest up, flat back.","es":"Pecho alto, espalda recta.","pt":"Peito alto, costas retas.","de":"Brust raus, Rücken gerade.","it":"Petto alto, schiena piatta.","nl":"Borst omhoog, rug recht.","pl":"Klatka w górę, plecy proste.","tr":"Göğüs yukarıda, sırt düz.","ja":"胸を張り、背中はまっすぐ。","ko":"가슴은 펴고 등은 곧게.","zh":"挺胸，背部平直。","ar":"الصدر مرفوع والظهر مستقيم.","id":"Dada tegak, punggung lurus."},
