"Râpez la pomme par-dessus.":{"en":"Grate the apple on top.","es":"Ralla la manzana por encima.","pt":"Rale a maçã por cima.","de":"Apfel darüber reiben.","it":"Grattugia la mela sopra.","nl":"Rasp de appel erover.","pl":"Zetrzyj jabłko na wierzch.","tr":"Elmayı üzerine rendele.","ja":"りんごを上にすりおろします。","ko":"사과를 위에 갈아 올리세요.","zh":"把苹果擦丝撒在上面。","ar":"ابشر التفاحة فوقه.","id":"Parut apel di atasnya."},
"Réception souple, genoux fléchis.":{"en":"Land softly, knees bent.","es":"Aterriza suave, con las rodillas flexionadas.","pt":"Aterrisse suavemente, joelhos flexionados.","de":"Weich landen, Knie gebeugt.","it":"Atterra morbido, ginocchia piegate.","nl":"Land zacht, knieën gebogen.","pl":"Ląduj miękko, kolana ugięte.","tr":"Yumuşak in, dizler bükük.","ja":"膝を曲げてやわらかく着地。","ko":"무릎을 굽혀 부드럽게 착지하세요.","zh":"轻柔落地，膝盖微屈。","ar":"اهبط بلطف والركبتان منثنيتان.","id":"Mendarat lembut, lutut ditekuk."},
"Réchauffez les haricots avec un peu d’oignon et d’ail.":{"en":"Warm the beans with a little onion and garlic.","es":"Calienta los frijoles con un poco de cebolla y ajo.","pt":"Aqueça o feijão com um pouco de cebola e alho.","de":"Bohnen mit etwas Zwiebel und Knoblauch erwärmen.","it":"Scalda i fagioli con un po’ di cipolla e aglio.","nl":"Warm de bonen op met wat ui en knoflook.","pl":"Podgrzej fasolę z odrobiną cebuli i czosnku.","tr":"Fasulyeyi biraz soğan ve sarımsakla ısıt.","ja":"豆を少量の玉ねぎとにんにくで温めます。","ko":"콩을 양파와 마늘 조금과 함께 데우세요.","zh":"豆子加少许洋葱和大蒜加热。","ar":"سخّن الفاصولياء مع قليل من البصل والثوم.","id":"Hangatkan kacang dengan sedikit bawang bombai dan bawang putih."},
"Réchauffez riz et haricots.":{"en":"Warm the rice and beans.","es":"Calienta el arroz y los frijoles.","pt":"Aqueça o arroz e o feijão.","de":"Reis und Bohnen erwärmen.","it":"Scalda riso e fagioli.","nl":"Warm de rijst en bonen op.","pl":"Podgrzej ryż i fasolę.","tr":"Pirinci ve fasulyeyi ısıt.","ja":"ご飯と豆を温めます。","ko":"밥과 콩을 데우세요.","zh":"加热米饭和豆子。","ar":"سخّن الأرز والفاصولياء.","id":"Hangatkan nasi dan kacang."},
"Réchauffez tortilla et haricots.":{"en":"Warm the tortilla and beans.","es":"Calienta la tortilla y los frijoles.","pt":"Aqueça a tortilha e o feijão.","de":"Tortilla und Bohnen erwärmen.","it":"Scalda la tortilla e i fagioli.","nl":"Warm de tortilla en bonen op.","pl":"Podgrzej tortillę i fasolę.","tr":"Tortillayı ve fasulyeyi ısıt.","ja":"トルティーヤと豆を温めます。","ko":"토르티야와 콩을 데우세요.","zh":"加热玉米饼和豆子。","ar":"سخّن التورتيلا والفاصولياء.","id":"Hangatkan tortila dan kacang."},
