"Rôtissez la patate douce en cubes.":{"en":"Roast the diced sweet potato.","es":"Asa el boniato en dados.","pt":"Asse a batata-doce em cubos.","de":"Süßkartoffelwürfel rösten.","it":"Arrostisci la patata dolce a cubetti.","nl":"Rooster de zoete-aardappelblokjes.","pl":"Upiecz batata pokrojonego w kostkę.","tr":"Küp doğranmış tatlı patatesi fırında kızart.","ja":"角切りのさつまいもをローストします。","ko":"깍둑썬 고구마를 구우세요.","zh":"烤红薯丁。","ar":"حمّص مكعبات البطاطا الحلوة.","id":"Panggang ubi potong dadu."},
"Rôtissez les légumes au four 20 minutes.":{"en":"Roast the vegetables in the oven for 20 minutes.","es":"Asa las verduras al horno 20 minutos.","pt":"Asse os legumes no forno por 20 minutos.","de":"Gemüse 20 Minuten im Ofen rösten.","it":"Arrostisci le verdure in forno per 20 minuti.","nl":"Rooster de groenten 20 minuten in de oven.","pl":"Piecz warzywa w piekarniku 20 minut.","tr":"Sebzeleri fırında 20 dakika kızart.","ja":"野菜をオーブンで20分ローストします。","ko":"채소를 오븐에 20분 구우세요.","zh":"蔬菜入烤箱烤 20 分钟。","ar":"حمّص الخضار في الفرن 20 دقيقة.","id":"Panggang sayur di oven 20 menit."},
"Saisissez le bœuf en lanières avec l’oignon.":{"en":"Sear the beef strips with the onion.","es":"Saltea la ternera en tiras con la cebolla.","pt":"Sele a carne em tiras com a cebola.","de":"Rindfleischstreifen mit der Zwiebel scharf anbraten.","it":"Scotta il manzo a striscioline con la cipolla.","nl":"Schroei de reepjes rundvlees met de ui.","pl":"Obsmaż paski wołowiny z cebulą.","tr":"Dana eti şeritlerini soğanla mühürle.","ja":"牛肉の細切りを玉ねぎと強火で焼きます。","ko":"소고기 채를 양파와 함께 센 불에 구우세요.","zh":"大火煸炒牛肉条和洋葱。","ar":"حمّر شرائح اللحم البقري مع البصل.","id":"Tumis cepat irisan daging sapi dengan bawang."},
"Saisissez le bœuf mariné au soja.":{"en":"Sear the soy-marinated beef.","es":"Saltea la ternera marinada en soja.","pt":"Sele a carne marinada no shoyu.","de":"In Soja mariniertes Rindfleisch scharf anbraten.","it":"Scotta il manzo marinato nella soia.","nl":"Schroei het in soja gemarineerde rundvlees.","pl":"Obsmaż wołowinę marynowaną w soi.","tr":"Soyada marine edilmiş dana etini mühürle.","ja":"しょうゆに漬けた牛肉を強火で焼きます。","ko":"간장에 재운 소고기를 센 불에 구우세요.","zh":"大火煎酱油腌牛肉。","ar":"حمّر اللحم البقري المتبّل بالصويا.","id":"Tumis cepat daging sapi yang dimarinasi kecap asin."},
"Saisissez le poulet émincé au wok.":{"en":"Sear the sliced chicken in the wok.","es":"Saltea el pollo en tiras en el wok.","pt":"Sele o frango fatiado na wok.","de":"Hähnchenstreifen im Wok scharf anbraten.","it":"Scotta il pollo a striscioline nel wok.","nl":"Schroei de reepjes kip in de wok.","pl":"Obsmaż pokrojonego kurczaka w woku.","tr":"Doğranmış tavuğu wokta mühürle.","ja":"切った鶏肉を中華鍋で強火で焼きます。","ko":"썬 닭고기를 웍에서 센 불에 볶으세요.","zh":"在炒锅中大火煸炒鸡肉片。","ar":"حمّر شرائح الدجاج في الووك.","id":"Tumis cepat irisan ayam di wajan."},
"Saisissez l’escalope et servez avec la moutarde.":{"en":"Sear the escalope and serve with mustard.","es":"Dora el escalope y sírvelo con mostaza.","pt":"Sele o escalope e sirva com mostarda.","de":"Schnitzel anbraten und mit Senf servieren.","it":"Scotta la scaloppina e servila con la senape.","nl":"Schroei de schnitzel en serveer met mosterd.","pl":"Obsmaż eskalopkę i podawaj z musztardą.","tr":"Şinitzeli mühürle ve hardalla servis et.","ja":"エスカロップを焼き、マスタードを添えます。","ko":"커틀릿을 굽고 머스터드와 함께 내세요.","zh":"煎肉排，配芥末上桌。","ar":"حمّر الشريحة وقدّمها مع الخردل.","id":"Panggang escalope dan sajikan dengan mustard."},
