"Salle ou maison, chaque séance guidée.":{"en":"Gym or home, every workout guided.","es":"Gimnasio o casa, cada sesión guiada.","pt":"Academia ou casa, cada treino guiado.","de":"Studio oder Zuhause, jede Einheit angeleitet.","it":"Palestra o casa, ogni seduta guidata.","nl":"Sportschool of thuis, elke training begeleid.","pl":"Siłownia lub dom, każdy trening z prowadzeniem.","tr":"Spor salonu ya da ev, her antrenman rehberli.","ja":"ジムでも自宅でも、すべてのトレーニングをガイド。","ko":"헬스장이든 집이든 모든 운동을 안내합니다.","zh":"健身房或居家，每次训练都有指导。","ar":"في النادي أو المنزل، كل تمرين موجّه.","id":"Gym atau rumah, setiap latihan dipandu."},
