"Vos préférences, NutriPilot construit les séances.":{"en":"Your preferences, NutriPilot builds the sessions.","es":"Tus preferencias; NutriPilot crea las sesiones.","pt":"Suas preferências; o NutriPilot monta os treinos.","de":"Deine Vorlieben, NutriPilot baut die Einheiten.","it":"Le tue preferenze, NutriPilot crea le sedute.","nl":"Jouw voorkeuren, NutriPilot stelt de trainingen samen.","pl":"Twoje preferencje, NutriPilot układa treningi.","tr":"Senin tercihlerin, antrenmanları NutriPilot oluşturur.","ja":"あなたの好みで、NutriPilotがメニューを組みます。","ko":"선호를 알려 주면 NutriPilot이 세션을 짭니다.","zh":"你的偏好，由 NutriPilot 安排训练。","ar":"تفضيلاتك، وNutriPilot يبني الحصص.","id":"Preferensimu, NutriPilot yang menyusun sesinya."},
