"À genoux, corde derrière la tête.":{"en":"Kneeling, rope behind your head.","es":"De rodillas, cuerda detrás de la cabeza.","pt":"Ajoelhado(a), corda atrás da cabeça.","de":"Kniend, Seil hinter dem Kopf.","it":"In ginocchio, corda dietro la testa.","nl":"Geknield, touw achter je hoofd.","pl":"Na kolanach, lina za głową.","tr":"Diz çökmüş, ip başının arkasında.","ja":"膝立ちで、ロープを頭の後ろに。","ko":"무릎 꿇고 로프는 머리 뒤에.","zh":"跪姿，绳索置于脑后。","ar":"راكعًا والحبل خلف رأسك.","id":"Berlutut, tali di belakang kepala."},
"À genoux, roue sous les épaules.":{"en":"Kneeling, wheel under your shoulders.","es":"De rodillas, rueda bajo los hombros.","pt":"Ajoelhado(a), roda abaixo dos ombros.","de":"Kniend, Roller unter den Schultern.","it":"In ginocchio, ruota sotto le spalle.","nl":"Geknield, wiel onder je schouders.","pl":"Na kolanach, kółko pod barkami.","tr":"Diz çökmüş, tekerlek omuzlarının altında.","ja":"膝立ちで、ローラーは肩の下に。","ko":"무릎 꿇고 롤러는 어깨 아래.","zh":"跪姿，健腹轮在肩膀下方。","ar":"راكعًا والعجلة تحت كتفيك.","id":"Berlutut, roda di bawah bahu."},
"À quatre pattes, une main derrière la tête.":{"en":"On all fours, one hand behind your head.","es":"A cuatro patas, una mano detrás de la cabeza.","pt":"De quatro apoios, uma mão atrás da cabeça.","de":"Im Vierfüßlerstand, eine Hand hinter dem Kopf.","it":"A quattro zampe, una mano dietro la testa.","nl":"Op handen en knieën, één hand achter je hoofd.","pl":"W klęku podpartym, jedna dłoń za głową.","tr":"Dört ayak üzerinde, bir el başının arkasında.","ja":"四つんばいで、片手を頭の後ろに。","ko":"네 발 자세, 한 손은 머리 뒤.","zh":"四足跪姿，一只手放在脑后。","ar":"على اليدين والركبتين ويد خلف الرأس.","id":"Posisi merangkak, satu tangan di belakang kepala."},
"Écartez la corde en bas du mouvement.":{"en":"Spread the rope apart at the bottom.","es":"Separa la cuerda al final del movimiento.","pt":"Abra a corda no final do movimento.","de":"Seil unten auseinanderziehen.","it":"Allarga la corda in fondo al movimento.","nl":"Trek het touw onderaan uit elkaar.","pl":"Rozsuń linę na dole.","tr":"Aşağıda ipi iki yana aç.","ja":"下でロープを左右に開きます。","ko":"아래에서 로프를 벌리세요.","zh":"在底部把绳索分开。","ar":"افتح الحبل في الأسفل.","id":"Renggangkan tali di bawah."},
"Écarté couché haltères":{"en":"Dumbbell fly","es":"Aperturas con mancuernas","pt":"Crucifixo com halteres","de":"Kurzhantel-Flys","it":"Croci con manubri","nl":"Dumbbell fly","pl":"Rozpiętki z hantlami","tr":"Dambıl fly","ja":"ダンベルフライ","ko":"덤벨 플라이","zh":"哑铃飞鸟","ar":"فتح بالدمبل","id":"Dumbbell fly"},
"Écrasez la patate douce en purée.":{"en":"Mash the sweet potato.","es":"Haz puré con el boniato.","pt":"Amasse a batata-doce.","de":"Süßkartoffel zu Püree stampfen.","it":"Schiaccia la patata dolce a purè.","nl":"Prak de zoete aardappel.","pl":"Rozgnieć batata.","tr":"Tatlı patatesi ez.","ja":"さつまいもをつぶします。","ko":"고구마를 으깨세요.","zh":"把红薯压成泥。","ar":"اهرس البطاطا الحلوة.","id":"Hancurkan ubi."},
