"Bien manger chaque jour, sans y passer des heures.":{"en":"Eat well every day, without spending hours on it.","es":"Comer bien cada día, sin pasarte horas en la cocina.","pt":"Comer bem todos os dias, sem passar horas na cozinha.","de":"Jeden Tag gut essen, ohne stundenlang zu kochen.","it":"Mangiare bene ogni giorno, senza passarci ore.","nl":"Elke dag goed eten, zonder er uren aan te besteden.","pl":"Dobrze jeść każdego dnia bez spędzania godzin w kuchni.","tr":"Saatler harcamadan her gün iyi beslen.","ja":"何時間もかけずに、毎日しっかり食べる。","ko":"몇 시간씩 들이지 않고 매일 잘 먹기.","zh":"每天吃得好，不必花上几个小时。","ar":"تناول طعامًا جيدًا كل يوم دون قضاء ساعات في المطبخ.","id":"Makan dengan baik setiap hari tanpa menghabiskan berjam-jam."},
