"valeurs courantes, modifiables":{"en":"typical values, editable","es":"valores habituales, editables","pt":"valores comuns, editáveis","de":"übliche Werte, änderbar","it":"valori comuni, modificabili","nl":"gangbare waarden, aanpasbaar","pl":"typowe wartości, do edycji","tr":"yaygın değerler, düzenlenebilir","ja":"一般的な値・編集可","ko":"일반적인 수치, 수정 가능","zh":"常见数值，可修改","ar":"قيم شائعة قابلة للتعديل","id":"nilai umum, bisa diubah"},
"Déjà client ? Recevez un code à 6 chiffres sur l’e-mail de votre achat.":{"en":"Already a customer? Get a 6-digit code at the email you used to buy.","es":"¿Ya eres cliente? Recibe un código de 6 cifras en el e-mail de tu compra.","pt":"Já é cliente? Receba um código de 6 dígitos no e-mail da sua compra.","de":"Schon Kunde? Erhalten Sie einen 6-stelligen Code an die E-Mail Ihres Kaufs.","it":"Sei già cliente? Ricevi un codice a 6 cifre all’e-mail dell’acquisto.","nl":"Al klant? Ontvang een 6-cijferige code op het e-mailadres van je aankoop.","pl":"Masz już konto? Otrzymaj 6-cyfrowy kod na e-mail użyty przy zakupie.","tr":"Zaten müşteri misin? Satın alma e-postana 6 haneli bir kod al.","ja":"すでにご利用中の方は、購入時のメールアドレスに6桁のコードをお送りします。","ko":"이미 고객이신가요? 구매 시 사용한 이메일로 6자리 코드를 받으세요.","zh":"已是会员？我们会向你购买时使用的邮箱发送 6 位验证码。","ar":"عميل بالفعل؟ استلم رمزًا من 6 أرقام على البريد الإلكتروني المستخدم في الشراء.","id":"Sudah jadi pelanggan? Dapatkan kode 6 digit di email yang Anda pakai saat membeli."},
"E-mail":{"en":"Email","es":"E-mail","pt":"E-mail","de":"E-Mail","it":"E-mail","nl":"E-mail","pl":"E-mail","tr":"E-posta","ja":"メールアドレス","ko":"이메일","zh":"邮箱","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني","id":"Email"},
