"Annulez quand vous voulez depuis votre compte App Store ou Google Play, sans frais pendant l’essai.":{"en":"Cancel whenever you like from your App Store or Google Play account, free of charge during the trial.","es":"Cancela cuando quieras desde tu cuenta de App Store o Google Play, sin coste durante la prueba.","pt":"Cancele quando quiser pela sua conta da App Store ou do Google Play, sem custo durante o teste.","de":"Kündigen Sie jederzeit in Ihrem App-Store- oder Google-Play-Konto – während des Tests kostenlos.","it":"Disdici quando vuoi dal tuo account App Store o Google Play, senza costi durante la prova.","nl":"Zeg op wanneer je wilt via je App Store- of Google Play-account, kosteloos tijdens de proefperiode.","pl":"Zrezygnuj w dowolnej chwili w koncie App Store lub Google Play, bez opłat w okresie próbnym.","tr":"App Store veya Google Play hesabından istediğin zaman iptal et; deneme süresince ücretsiz.","ja":"App StoreまたはGoogle Playのアカウントからいつでも解約でき、無料期間中は料金がかかりません。","ko":"App Store 또는 Google Play 계정에서 언제든 해지할 수 있으며, 체험 기간에는 요금이 없습니다.","zh":"可随时在 App Store 或 Google Play 账户中取消，试用期内不收费。","ar":"ألغِ متى شئت من حسابك في App Store أو Google Play، دون رسوم خلال الفترة التجريبية.","id":"Batalkan kapan saja dari akun App Store atau Google Play, gratis selama masa uji coba."},
